&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working and collaborating with diverse, high-performing teams in a rapidly growing or hyper-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to dive deep into fulfillment data, extract insights, and deploy scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex logistics projects while leading and influencing various stakeholders, from frontline associates to corporate leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated commitment to operational excellence, workplace safety, and exceptional leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to mentor, coach, and develop both junior supervisors and senior operations leaders.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
