&lt;p&gt;我們正在尋覓人才協助我們帶領 Coupang 台灣拓展業務。這是個難得的機會，一同參與 Coupang 在台灣的成長，打造一個讓我們的顧客自問「沒有 Coupang，我該怎麼過活？」的世界。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;職位: Assistant Manager, Pricing Operation Management （電商價格審核專案）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will you do?&lt;br&gt;• 團隊領導與管理： 協助支持 5-7 人團隊的日常營運，負責績效追蹤、人力安排協調及工作流程優化，確保專案順利執行並持續提升營運效率&lt;br&gt;• 定價專案數據分析： 追蹤並彙報定價專案之關鍵績效指標 (KPI)，分析數據趨勢，並透過數據驅動的方法提出改善策略，以提升整體績效表現。&lt;br&gt;• 流程優化與改善： 評估現有作業流程中的效率問題，提出具體且可執行的優化建議，持續改善工作流程並提升專案執行成果。&lt;br&gt;• 品質控管與培訓指導： 負責派遣人員產出之品質考核，並針對表現落差提供專業培訓與指導，以確保作業準確度及專業水平。&lt;br&gt;• 教育訓練執行： 負責新進人員教育訓練，並持續優化培訓教材與相關作業文件。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basic Requirements：&lt;br&gt;• 相關經驗： 具備營運分析（Operational Analysis）或相關職務經驗。&lt;br&gt;• 數據分析能力： 具備優秀分析能力，熟悉 SQL、Python，以及 Tableau 等資料視覺化工具。&lt;br&gt;• 問題解決能力： 工作細心，具備耐心與主動積極的工作態度，能獨立分析問題並提出解決方案。&lt;br&gt;• 溝通與協作能力： 具備良好的溝通與簡報技巧，能有效與跨部門團隊及各利害關係人合作。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;招募流程：&lt;br&gt;• 申請資格審核 – &lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;職務適任面試&lt;/span&gt; – &lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;核心能力面試&lt;/span&gt; – 錄取通知&lt;br&gt;• 招聘流程的確切性質可能會根據具體工作而有所不同，並且可能會因日程安排或其他情況而發生變化。&lt;br&gt;• 面試時間表和結果將透過電子郵件地址通知應徵人員。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;需要考慮的事項：&lt;br&gt;• 如果空缺職位已填補，則此職位發布可能會在規定的申請結束日期之前關閉。&lt;br&gt;• 如果發現候選人在申請過程中提交了虛假信息，Coupang 有權撤銷聘用邀請。&lt;br&gt;• Coupang 不歧視殘疾申請人或退伍軍人。 我們很自豪能為所有申請人提供平等的機會。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Assistant Manager, Sortation Management&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is directly responsible for the safe, accurate, and efficient processing (sorting/staging) of inbound volume at the Sub-HUB sort center. This role&#39;s primary focus is on ensuring volume is correctly prepared and loaded for timely dispatch to the last mile delivery stations (CAMPs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volume Flow Execution: Assists in managing the inbound linehaul receiving process and ensures rapid, accurate sorting onto outbound vehicles destined for specific CAMPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Labor Planning &amp;amp; Supervision: Develops and executes the daily, volume-dependent labor plan for sort associates. Manages shift schedules, time-off requests, and performance coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safety &amp;amp; Quality: Maintains a safe working environment on the dock and sort floor. Oversees quality checks to minimize sortation errors that impact the downstream customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linehaul Oversight: Ensures all outbound vehicles are correctly loaded and dispatched according to the predetermined On-Time Departure schedule (CPTs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inventory Control: Manages and tracks internal package movement and exceptions within the Sub-HUB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of leadership or supervisory experience in warehouse, hub, or sortation center logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People &amp;amp; Labor Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct experience creating volume-based shift plans, managing associate scheduling, and providing performance coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linehaul &amp;amp; Dispatch Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with inbound receiving, dock operations, package staging, and meeting strict Critical Pull Times (CPTs) / On-Time Departure schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety &amp;amp; Quality Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of enforcing workplace safety protocols on a dock/sort floor and running quality checks to minimize sorting errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory Control:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in using package tracking systems, managing internal inventory flow, and resolving operational exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; High School Diploma or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s or Master&#39;s degree in Supply Chain Management, Logistics, Business Administration, or an operations-related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics Network Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct background in middle-mile sort centers, hub-and-spoke models, or last-mile delivery station (CAMP) operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience or certifications in Lean, Six Sigma, or continuous process improvement methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Systems Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency with Warehouse Management Systems (WMS), labor planning software, and data analytics tools for volume forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
