&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As a Capacity Planning Specialist (Lastmile Management), you will support logistics capacity planning across last mile and middle mile operations. This role focuses on executing daily and monthly planning tasks, conducting data analysis, and providing operational insights to help improve efficiency. You will collaborate closely with cross-functional teams to ensure accurate forecasting and smooth operational execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Support the execution of capacity planning models for last mile logistics, ensuring consistency with operational guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Perform daily and monthly manpower and asset planning activities, working with operations teams to ensure timely completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Analyze basic driver performance and cost data to identify trends and support efficiency improvements at the route or area level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Assist in maintaining and enhancing workforce planning tools to improve forecasting accuracy and operational responsiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Prepare regular reports and dashboards to support business decision‑making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．3+ years of experience in planning operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Hands‑on experience in Excel and data operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Strong attention to detail with a data‑driven mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Good communication and collaboration skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Proficiency in MS Office, Advanced Excel, Google Sheets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Degree in Business, Logistics, Supply Chain, Industrial Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;．Experience in logistics last mile or middle mile operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;．&lt;/span&gt;Basic English verbal communication skills for discussion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
