&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;회사 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang Logistics Service (이하 CLS)는 택배사업, 화물운송, 화물주선, 물류창고, 화물분류 등 종합 물류 서비스를 제공하는 쿠팡의 물류전문 계열사입니다. CLS는 국토교통부로 지정받은 택배 운송 사업자로서 전국 단위의 배송 캠프에서 업계 최초로 도입한 분류작업 전담 인력과 직영 전문 배송직 쿠팡친구, 그리고 전국 단위 택배 영업점을 통해 고객에게 최적의 배송 서비스를 제공하면서 쿠팡의 로켓배송을 완결하는 역할을 담당하고 있습니다. 로켓배송을 통해 미래 물류의 혁신을 이끌어 온 종합물류서비스 기업으로서 CLS는 로켓배송의 노하우, 인프라, 네트워크 등을 연계하여 물류 혁신을 통한 더 나은 고객감동을 만들어 나갈 것입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;직무 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CLS Logistics Process 팀은 Automation 자동화 설비의 제어 시스템 설계 및 운영을 총괄하며, WMS/WCS 연동, PLC 및 SCADA 인터페이스 정의, 데이터 표준화, 알람 분석, 유지보수, SW/HW 표준화 등을 통해 설비의 안정성과 운영 효율을 극대화합니다. 서브허브 센터(Sub-Hub)란? 서브허브 센터는 쿠팡 물류센터와 배송센터 사이에 위치한 중간 분류 단계의 사업장을 지칭합니다. 고객이 상품을 주문하면 쿠팡 물류센터에서 상품이 출고되어 고객이 거주하는 지역에 위치한 서브허브 센터로 이동하게 됩니다. 서브허브 센터에서는 지역 내 배송센터별로 상품을 분류하여 이동시키고, 배송센터는 서브허브 센터로부터 상품을 전달받아 고객에게 배송하게 됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;주요 업무&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;1. Automation Launch Project Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AutoSorter 구축 프로젝트 E2E PM 수행&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor 제어 설계 Design Review 수행&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PLC, 전장, 인터페이스, Safety 설계 검증&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FAT / SIT / SAT 및 운영 안정화 리딩&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lesson Learned 반영을 통한 설계 표준 고도화&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;2. Automation System Ownership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CLS Auto-Sorter 제어 시스템 운영 총괄&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;운영 KPI 관리 및 성능 분석&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;장애 트러블슈팅, RCA (Root Cause Analysis) 수행 및 재발 방지 대책 수립&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SOP, Technical Standard, Troubleshooting Guide 구축 및 관리&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lesson Learned 기반 표준화 및 Best Practice 수평 전개&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;3. Lesson Learned &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;데이터 기반 문제 정의 및 개선 과제 발굴&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution 기획 및 실행&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cost / ROI / Business Impact 분석&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;개선 효과 Tracking 및 표준화 추진&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;4. Technical Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PLC, 전장설계, SCADA, WMS/WCS Interface 기술 검토&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor 기술 리딩 및 기술 의사결정 지원&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;복잡한 Automation 이슈에 대한 기술적 해결책 제시&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;5. Smart Automation Platform&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SCADA, CMMS 및 운영 플랫폼 구축/고도화&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;설비 데이터 수집 및 시각화 체계 구축&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;자격 요건&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;• 전기·전자·제어공학 관련 전공 학사 이상 보유하신 분&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;• 자동화 설비 제어설계 경력 5년 이상이신 분&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;• 스마트 팩토리, 물류 자동화 제어설계(HW/SW) 경험이 있으신 분&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;• 주요 PLC 브랜드(Siemens, Mitsubishi, Omron 등) 사용 경험이 있으신 분&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;• AutoCAD, EPLAN 등 전기 설계 툴 활용 능력이 있으신 분&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;• WMS/WCS 시스템 연동 및 PLC 데이터 분석 경험이 있으신 분&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;• SCADA 시스템 설계 및 인터페이스 구현 경험이 있으신 분&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;• &lt;/span&gt;전기 유지보수 및 설비 경험 및&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; SW/HW &lt;/span&gt;및 알람 데이터 표준화 경험이 있으신 분&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우대&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;• 택배 물류 자동화 설비 경험자 (Sorter)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;• Excel, Power BI &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;등&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;데이터&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;분석&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;도구&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;활용&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;능력이&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;있으신&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;분&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형 절차 및&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;안내&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;절차&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;서류전형 - 직무 적합성 인터뷰 - 핵심 역량 인터뷰 - 최종 합격&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형절차는 직무별로 다르게 운영될 수 있으며, 일정 및 상황에 따라 변동될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형 일정 및 결과는 지원서에 등록하신 이메일로 개별 안내 드립니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;참고&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 공고는 모집 완료 시 조기 마감될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;지원서 내용 중 허위사실이 있는 경우에는 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;취업 보호 대상자(보훈대상자, 장애인 등)는 관련 법률에 따라 채용우대를 받을 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;직급과 담당 업무 범위는 후보자의 전반적인 경력과 경험 등 제반사정을 고려하여 변경될 수 있습니다. 이러한 변경이 필요할 경우, 최종 합격 통지 전 적절한 시기에 후보자와 커뮤니케이션 될 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;채용 및 업무 수행과 관련하여 요구되는 법령상 자격이 갖추어지지 않은 경우 채용이 제한될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;고용형태는 정규직으로 수습기간 12주를 포함합니다. 단, 업무상 필요한 경우에는 상기 수습기간을 적용하지 않거나 단축 또는 연장할 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;개인정보 처리방침&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;쿠팡 그룹은 입사지원자 개인정보 처리방침(아래 링크)에 따라 귀하의 개인정보를 수집하여 처리합니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;서류&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;반환 정책&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 고지는 『채용절차의공정화에관한법률』 제11조제6항에 따른 것 입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사 채용에 응시한 구직자 중 최종 합격이 되지 못한 구직자는 『채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률』에 따라 제출한 채용서류의 반환을 청구할 수 있음을 알려 드립니다. 다만, 홈페이지 또는 전자우편으로 제출된 경우나 구직자가 당사의 요구 없이 자발적으로 제출한 경우에는 그러하지 아니하며, 천재지변이나 그 밖에 당사에게 책임 없는 사유로 채용서류가 멸실된 경우에는 반환한 것으로 봅니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;위2항 본문에 따라 채용 서류 반환 청구를 하는 구직자는 채용 서류 반환 청구서 [채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률 시행규칙 별지 제 3 호 서식]를 작성하여 이메일 (&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitingops@coupang.com&quot;&gt;recruitingops@coupangcls.com&lt;/a&gt;) 로 제출하면, 제출이 확인된 날로부터 14 일 이내에 지정한 주소지로 등기우편을 통하여 발송해 드립니다. 이 경우 등기우편요금은 수신자 부담으로 하게 되오니 유념하시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사는 위2항 본문에 따른 구직자의 반환 청구에 대비하여 채용 여부가 확정된 날로부터 180 일간 구직자가 제출한 채용서류 원본을 보관하게 되며, 그때까지 채용서류의 반환을 청구하지 아니할 경우에는 『개인정보 보호법』에 따라 지체 없이 채용서류 일체를 파기할 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;단, 위 1항 내지 4항의 내용은 대한민국의 노동 관계 법령이 적용되는 경우에만 적용됩니다. 그 이외의 경우에는 적용되지 않습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top: 3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;ko&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Director of TW Logistics Launch &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;ko&quot;&gt;is an executive leadership role responsible for steering the end-to-end physical infrastructure and launch lifecycle across Taiwan. This position leads multi-site fulfillment network expansion—spanning land banking, real estate investment structuring, build-to-suit construction, advanced layout/CAD design, MEP engineering compliance, material handling equipment (MHE) automation, and operational launch readiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top: 3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Working at the strategic level, the Director orchestrates annual infrastructure planning, manages multi-million dollar CAPEX/OPEX budgets, oversees complex regulatory permitting, and leads specialized engineering/launch teams (Equipment, Construction, Automation Control, Real Estate, and Capacity Planning) to execute flawless greenfield and brownfield launches in a high-growth E-commerce ecosystem.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strategic Infrastructure Program &amp;amp; Capacity Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; vertical-align: middle; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Annual Infrastructure Plan &amp;amp; Master Strategy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; Formulate and execute Taiwan’s long-term infrastructure master plan, aligning network expansion, hub/sub-hub/camp footprints, and capital allocation with corporate business projections.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; vertical-align: middle; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Portfolio-Level Program Management:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; Oversee end-to-end program delivery (PMO) for multiple concurrent greenfield and brownfield site launches, managing critical path milestones, risk escalation protocols, and execution dashboards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; vertical-align: middle; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Network &amp;amp; Labor Capacity Optimization:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; Oversee node-level volume forecasting, capacity allocation, and manpower planning frameworks to maximize fixed overhead absorption and prevent throughput bottlenecks across Last-mile and Middle-mile operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Real Estate Development, Build-to-Suit &amp;amp; Permitting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real Estate Strategy &amp;amp; Land Acquisition:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead macro-level site selection, land banking, build-to-suit (BTS) developments, forward-funding models, and complex commercial real estate lease/purchase negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investment Governance &amp;amp; Capital Allocation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and defend high-stakes business cases, financial models, and underwriting proposals for C-level and institutional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permitting &amp;amp; Government Relations:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive institutional stakeholder management to navigate local government entitlements, zoning compliances, environmental impact assessments, building permits, and fire safety certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction Management, Engineering &amp;amp; Site Oversight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; vertical-align: middle; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Construction Execution &amp;amp; Contractor Oversight:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; Lead the complete construction delivery lifecycle—from contractor tendering and daily site supervision to quality defect resolution, structural inspections, and operational handover.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; vertical-align: middle; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Multi-Disciplinary Engineering Governance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; Direct technical execution across Civil Engineering, MEP (Mechanical, Electrical, Plumbing), High-Voltage Electricity, Fire Fighting Systems, and IT Network Infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; vertical-align: middle; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Layout Design &amp;amp; CAD Management:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; Direct warehouse layout engineering, internal flow optimization, CAD drawings review, and spatial interface checks for greenfield and brownfield facilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Logistics Equipment &amp;amp; Automation Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Procurement &amp;amp; Incoterms Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee global and local procurement strategies for operation-critical MHE (conveyors, sorters, racks). Direct cross-border workflows, vendor selection, and Incoterms 2020 execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Automation System Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead technical teams in reviewing Auto-Sorter designs, PLC controls (Siemens, Mitsubishi, Omron), SCADA platforms, EPLAN schematics, and WMS/WCS system interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Site Installation &amp;amp; Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT), Site Integration Testing (SIT), and Site Acceptance Testing (SAT) to ensure high-voltage safety and automated operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budgeting, EHS &amp;amp; Change Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; vertical-align: middle; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;CAPEX / OPEX Financial Ownership:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; Own total financial responsibility for infrastructure expenditures; structure, track, and optimize multi-million dollar CAPEX and launch OPEX budgets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; vertical-align: middle; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Safety &amp;amp; Regulatory Compliance (EHS):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; Enforce strict local/international building regulations and internal EHS standards across all construction sites and automated facilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; vertical-align: middle; color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Innovative Mindset &amp;amp; Change Management:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; Drive continuous process innovation (PI), smart factory data collection, and standardized trouble-shooting guides to thrive in a fast-paced, ambiguous e-commerce environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;ko&quot;&gt; 12–15+ years of progressive leadership experience in logistics real estate development, facility construction management, engineering launch programs, or industrial expansion within high-growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;E-commerce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;ko&quot;&gt;, 3PL, or Retail Supply Chain sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Education:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;ko&quot;&gt; Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Civil Engineering, Construction Management, Electrical/Control Engineering, Real Estate, Industrial Engineering, or a related technical discipline. Advanced certifications (e.g., PMP, Professional Engineer/PE, Architect license) are highly desirable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Domain Expertise: &lt;/span&gt;Industrial / logistics industry domain knowledge and familiar with market. Demonstrated track record of executing greenfield and brownfield warehouse launches, incorporating AutoCAD designs, structural engineering, MEP systems, and local Taiwan building codes/permitting. (Small-scale sites with a Gross Floor Area (GFA) under 5,000 pyeong (approx. 16,500 m²) Hands-on familiarity with automated sorting systems, MHE procurement, vendor contract management, and PLC/SCADA control frameworks.&amp;nbsp;Deep knowledge of end-to-end real estate expansion: site underwriting, land banking, BTS developer management, and municipal entitlements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Data Acumen&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong expertise in multi-million dollar CAPEX/OPEX budget management, ROI modeling, and value engineering.&amp;nbsp;Proficiency in data-driven management, KPI tracking, and executive dashboard tools (e.g., Tableau, Power BI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven ability to manage multidisciplinary teams (civil/automation engineers, real estate managers, PMO leads) and external stakeholders (contractors, government officials, vendors). High adaptability to dynamic environments (&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Familiar with Changes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;ko&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;) with an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Innovative Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;ko&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt; focused on scalable supply chain infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(29, 28, 29);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;span lang=&quot;ko&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt; Professional fluency in both spoken and written &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;ko&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Mandarin (Chinese)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;ko&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt; is strictly required for cross-border collaboration and local regulatory alignment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Recruitment Process and Others &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Recruitment Process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application Review - Job Fit Interview - Focus Interview – Offer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;29&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The exact nature of the recruitment process may vary according to the specific job and may be changed due to scheduling or other circumstances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;29&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Interview schedules and the results will be informed to the applicant via the e-mail address submitted at the application stage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
