&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Background &amp;amp; Regulatory Expertise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of hands-on experience in Food Regulatory Affairs, with deep knowledge of food ingredient restrictions, permitted usages, and advertising claim regulations. Proven track record in negotiating with regulatory authorities to successfully mitigate non-compliance concerns highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid understanding of regulatory frameworks for Medicine, Medical Devices, and Cosmetics, including statutory definitions of medical efficacy and false/exaggerated advertising. Experience in conducting regulatory category determinations for borderline products (e.g., distinguishing among general merchandise, cosmetics, medical devices, and pharmaceuticals) preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
