&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Message Structuring:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled at translating and simplifying complex regulatory issues into structured, easy-to-understand insights, with the ability to provide clear, concise, and actionable instructions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
