&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Analysis &amp;amp; Advice:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong analytical skills to synthesize complex information into structured logic, providing practical execution plans based on resource availability and risk assessment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logical Acumen &amp;amp; Gap Spotting:&lt;/strong&gt; High sensitivity to textual logic, capable of quickly identifying contradictions within regulations or internal policies, as well as operational gaps in execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
