&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA graduates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a minimum of 3 years of experience in finance, operations, business development/management, strategy development etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid team player; work cooperatively and effectively in a team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative / analytical / problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal / communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self motivated, reliable, passionate, and can keep to deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
