&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did&amp;nbsp;I&amp;nbsp;ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we&amp;nbsp;are collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar commerce industry from the ground up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;and&amp;nbsp;establishing&amp;nbsp;an unparalleled reputation for being&amp;nbsp;leading&amp;nbsp;and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our&amp;nbsp;inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of&amp;nbsp;what’s&amp;nbsp;possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang Rocket Growth is one of exciting organization that serves both customer and sellers by offering hundreds of thousands sellers the opportunity to list and sell millions of products to tens of millions of customers with &quot;Rocket Delivery&quot; experience every day. FP&amp;amp;A supporting this business will be a key finance partner reporting directly to the head of Finance of Rocket Growth and the job will make a big difference to both customers and sellers as the business aim to widening selections for customer to shop in best available price with next day and even same day delivery promise. Finance partner is a key enabler for the business growth and provide guidance, advice and influence key business decisions with quantifiable impacts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owner of reporting key metrics, such as gmv, gross profit, net margin, contribution margin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owner of building in-depth visibility and set up financial guardrails of rocket growth business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting and planning financial related to Rocket Growth business with solid strong input metrics modeling skillset to help build trust-worth forecast modeling with 95%+ accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ad-hoc financial analytics based on business need, such as ROI analysis of fee waiving program, financial modeling and impact assessment of new business initiatives and potential fee change implication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full profit and loss ownership for overall rocket growth business to present key financials insights to business leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity identifier on profitability improvement and a key driver of continuously driving initiatives of supporting business growth and profitability improvement to meet financial guardrails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate effectively in English for day-to-day work and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A total of 7+ years of relevant finance/accounting experience, including 5+ years of direct FP&amp;amp;A experience with exposure to the full P&amp;amp;L&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with business and finance stakeholders across functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical data analysis skills, including data preparation, validation, analysis, and presentation of findings&lt;/li&gt;
