&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;32&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;14&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as&amp;nbsp;stated&amp;nbsp;in the Application Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;located&amp;nbsp;below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/en/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/en/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Document Return Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This notification is given&amp;nbsp;pursuant to&amp;nbsp;Article 11 (6) of the Fair Hiring Procedure Act.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A job applicant, who has applied but&amp;nbsp;not&amp;nbsp;been finally selected for a position at Coupang (the “Company”), may request the Company to return his/her hiring documents&amp;nbsp;submitted&amp;nbsp;pursuant to&amp;nbsp;the Fair Hiring Procedure Act. However, this will not apply where the hiring documents were&amp;nbsp;submitted&amp;nbsp;via the website of the Company or e-mail, or where the job applicant&amp;nbsp;submitted&amp;nbsp;those documents voluntarily without a request from&amp;nbsp;the Company. In addition, if the hiring documents were destroyed due to a natural disaster or any other reasons not attributable to the Company, such documents will be&amp;nbsp;deemed&amp;nbsp;to have been returned to the job applicant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A job applicant who wishes to request the return of his/her hiring documents pursuant to the main sentence of paragraph 2 above should fill out a “Request for Return of Hiring Documents” [Annex Form No. 3 in the Enforcement Rule of the Fair Hiring Procedure Act] and&amp;nbsp;submit It&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;by email&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;recruitingops@coupang.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;. In&amp;nbsp;such case, within fourteen (14) days from the date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;of&amp;nbsp;identifying&amp;nbsp;the receipt of the request, the Company will send the hiring documents to the job applicant’s designated address via registered mail. Please be informed that the job applicant&amp;nbsp;is required to&amp;nbsp;pay the postage on the registered mail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In preparation for a job applicant’s request for the return of hiring documents&amp;nbsp;pursuant to&amp;nbsp;the main sentence of paragraph 2 above, the Company shall&amp;nbsp;retain&amp;nbsp;the original hiring documents&amp;nbsp;submitted&amp;nbsp;by the job applicant for&amp;nbsp;180 days&amp;nbsp;from the completion of the recruiting process. If no request is made until the end of this period,&amp;nbsp;all&amp;nbsp;his/her hiring documents will be destroyed&amp;nbsp;immediately&amp;nbsp;in accordance with&amp;nbsp;the Personal Information Protection Act.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The above paragraphs 1 - 4 shall only apply when the labor-related laws of Korea govern the application. They are otherwise not applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did I ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we are collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar commerce industry from the ground up&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;and establishing an unparalleled reputation for being leading and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Description&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People Systems Administration(PSA) team owns and evolves Coupang&#39;s recruiting and related HR technology ecosystem. Supporting more than 14 platforms, PSA is responsible for system stability, technology adoption, integration architecture, and platform governance across the recruiting landscape. The team works closely with Recruiting, People Operations, Corporate IT, and global technology partners to improve scalability, operational excellence, and business value. Beyond day-to-day operations, PSA is building the foundations for data-driven decision making and future AI-enabled capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Role Overview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang operates a complex technology ecosystem that connects recruiting platforms, enterprise integrations, data flows, and emerging AI capabilities. As this ecosystem continues to expand, People Systems Administration(PSA) is investing in dedicated leadership for architecture, integration governance, and data strategy. This is not a traditional system administration role. As a Principal-level individual contributor, you will influence technology decisions, define scalable standards, and shape the future direction of Coupang&#39;s recruiting and associated HR technology landscape. Working closely with Recruiting, People Operations, Corporate IT, and global technology partners, you will help build the foundations that enable future growth, automation, and AI-driven innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW8928612 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW8928612 BCX0&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture strategy and integration roadmap for Coupang&#39;s recruiting technology ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and govern integration architecture standards across recruiting systems, including APIs, webhooks, middleware platforms, and data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical reviews and architectural assessments for platforms such as Greenhouse, Eightfold, BrightHire, and internally developed solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary technical escalation point for complex cross-system incidents, coordinating root cause analysis and resolution across multiple vendors and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Corporate IT, Security, Privacy, and Compliance teams to strengthen governance, risk management, and data protection practices across the recruiting technology ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop long-term technology roadmaps, integration strategies, and AI-ready data foundations that improve scalability and maximize the value of existing technology investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW8928612 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW239492669 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW239492669 BCX0&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing technology decisions across multiple stakeholder groups without direct reporting authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in IS / HRIS Architecture, Enterprise Integration Engineering, Technical Product Management, or related disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing and supporting enterprise integrations using REST APIs, SOAP APIs, webhooks, middleware platforms, and data modeling principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL, data analysis, and troubleshooting complex system integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting business-critical enterprise platforms with complex integration, security, or compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Korean language skills and professional English communication skills capable of collaborating with global stakeholders and technology vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW30116870 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW30116870 BCX0&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW8928612 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW239492669 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW177940502 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177940502 BCX0&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing enterprise architecture, integration governance, or technology standards in a multi-vendor SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing HR technology strategies, operating models, or long-term technology roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data governance, privacy regulations, information security controls, or compliance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting AI-enabled talent acquisition technologies or AI-readiness initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring technical teams and establishing scalable technical standards and governance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Recruitment Process and Others&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Recruitment Process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
