&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is seeking a Director of Product Management to lead our Supply Chain Management Automation (SCMA) portfolio in Taiwan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This leader will own the strategy, roadmap, and execution of systems that determine what to order, when to order, and how much to order across Coupang&#39;s retail supply chain. You will partner closely with Engineering, Data Science, Retail, and Operations teams to build highly automated, model-driven decision systems that improve inventory availability, purchasing efficiency, and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly strategic role focused on solving complex business problems through optimization, machine learning, and AI-enabled automation. You will lead a growing team of Product Managers while helping define the future of supply chain decision-making at Coupang.&lt;/p&gt;
