&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang Taiwan is looking for a highly technical Program Management leader to reimagine catalog quality and catalog operations through AI and LLM-powered solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of Program Management, Product Management, Data, and AI. The successful candidate will lead the design and implementation of scalable workflows that automatically identify, evaluate, and resolve catalog quality issues across millions of product listings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unlike traditional program management roles, this position requires a hands-on builder mindset. The ideal candidate is comfortable leveraging LLMs, designing data pipelines, creating MVPs with small teams, and rapidly scaling successful solutions across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
