&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Seoul, South Korea&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Coupang&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Coupang, we exist to wow our customers. Our mission is to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever before. We’re disrupting the multi-billion-dollar commerce industry from the ground up and building a reputation as South Korea’s most innovative and reliable e-commerce platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We combine the agility of a startup with the scale and resources of a global public company. This unique blend empowers us to launch new services at speed, drive innovation, and make a tangible impact every day. At Coupang, you’ll grow alongside bold, hands-on, and ambitious teammates who are passionate about shaping the future of commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On Rocket Growth (RG):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rocket Growth is a dynamic business unit focused on driving innovation, scale, and strategic growth across emerging markets and categories. We are building a brand that stands for bold thinking, transformative impact, and future-forward leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;A. Sales Planning &amp;amp; Performance Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary planning partner to designated Category Leaders, coordinating and driving the annual, quarterly, and ongoing sales planning processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Goal Setting &amp;amp; Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and maintain robust performance tracking mechanisms (KPIs, OKRs) to monitor category sales execution against strategic objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep-Dive Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct detailed, hypothesis-driven analysis of sales performance, market trends, and category performance to identify risks, opportunities, and areas for optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;B. Strategic Storytelling &amp;amp; Executive Presentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Narrative Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and build compelling, clear, and concise strategic &#39;storylines&#39; and presentations for consumption by Sales Leadership and Executive Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Readouts:&lt;/strong&gt; Present key findings, strategic recommendations, and performance summaries with conviction, translating complex planning and tracking data into actionable business insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rapid-Turnaround:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage a &#39;management consulting&#39; mindset to quickly synthesize complex information and transform it into highly polished, presentation-ready formats under tight deadlines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;C. Team Leadership &amp;amp; Asset Scalability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage, coach, and develop a team of Analysts/Planners, ensuring high quality and consistency in their analytical outputs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scalable Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the team in the development and implementation of reusable, automated, and scalable planning and tracking assets (e.g., dashboards, templates, data models).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the transition toward a &lt;strong&gt;&#39;self-serve&#39;&lt;/strong&gt; data model, enabling the broader sales team to access performance data and tracking insights directly and efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;II. Required Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10-15 years of professional experience in Sales Operations, Business Planning, Strategy, or a related analytical function, preferably supporting a high-intensity, fast-paced Sales organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structure &amp;amp; Detail:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated history of being &lt;strong&gt;highly structured and meticulous&lt;/strong&gt; in planning, execution, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency in data analysis and modeling (e.g., Excel, SQL, Tableau/Power BI) and the ability to derive strategic insights from large datasets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with a proven ability to summarize complex issues into a crisp, consumable storyline for executive audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;III. Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Management Consulting:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience at a top-tier management consulting firm is a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience managing or mentoring analytical staff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Expertise in CRM systems (e.g., Salesforce), planning tools, and Business Intelligence platforms (Tableau).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application Review - Phone Interview - Onsite (or Virtual Onsite) Interview – Offer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The exact nature of the recruitment process may vary according to the specific job and may be changed due to scheduling or other circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview schedules and the results will be informed to the applicant via the e-mail address submitted at the application stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things to Consider&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This job posting may be closed prior to the stated end date for application if all openings are filled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coupang has the right to rescind an offer of employment if a candidate is found to have submitted false information as part of the application process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coupang does not discriminate against disabled applicants or those with veteran status. We are proud to offer equal opportunities for all applicants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice​&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;회사 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CLS는 국토교통부로 지정받은 택배 운송 사업자로서 전국 단위의 배송 캠프에서 업계 최초로 도입한 분류작업 전담 인력과 직영 전문 배송직 쿠팡친구, 그리고 전국 단위 택배 영업점을 통해 고객에게 최적의 배송 서비스를 제공하면서 쿠팡의 로켓배송을 완결하는 역할을 담당하고 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;로켓배송을 통해 미래 물류의 혁신을 이끌어 온 종합물류서비스 기업으로서 CLS는 로켓배송의 노하우, 인프라, 네트워크 등을 연계하여 물류 혁신을 통한 더 나은 고객감동을 만들어 나갈 것입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;직무 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang의 물류 네트워크는 전진형 물류 센터 거점 구조로 고객 감동을 빠르게 확장하고 있습니다. &lt;br&gt;해당 포지션은 SCM 관점에서 재고 배치 최적화, 센터 간 이관 전략, 그리고 E2E 공급망 관리를 지향하며, Rocket 배송과 다양한 배송 서비스의 원가 경쟁력과 고객 경험을 결정짓는 핵심 의사결정을 리드합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;또한, Logistics Supply Chain Innovation 조직 전체의 전략 방향을 설정하고, 물류, Finance, Tech, Retail, Operation 등 내,외부 유관 조직과의 얼라인을 통해 Coupang 물류 혁신 로드맵을 실행합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;업무 내용&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Inventory Strategy &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전진형 중소형 물류센터와 보충센터의 재고 보관 최적화 전략 수립 및 실행&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network 재고 총량/회전율·DOC(Days of Coverage) 목표 관리&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;센터 간 이관(Transfer) 전략 설계 및 재고 건전성 프로그램 총괄&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. Fulfillment Operations Innovation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IB / Transfer 전 영역의 Capacity Planning 및 Bottleneck 해소&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peak Season 대응 Plan 수립 및 실행 리드&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply Chain 관점의 결품 최소화 및 재고 흐름 최적화&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3. ICQA (Inventory Control and Quality Assurance)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;오류의 근본 원인 분석 및 검증(DMAIC)을 통한 품질 개선 &amp;amp; 재고 결함 감소 활동&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SBC, CC 등 재고 조사 기법을 통한 사전 예방 관리 감독&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SOP 수립 및 관리 감독&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4. Cross-functional Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FC Ops, Retail, Tech, Finance와의 협업 체계 구축&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;내,외부 조직 간의 협업 체계 구축&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VP 레벨 Mitigation·Escalation 이슈 대응 및 의사결정 지원&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;신규 PICO(Pallet In Case Out) 센터 재고 배치 전략 설계 및 Go-live 협업&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;자격&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;요건&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;학사 이상 &amp;amp; 물류·이커머스·제조업의 SCM/Operations 분야 15년 이상 경력&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;조직 관리 경험 보유&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E2E Supply Chain Management(Vendor - FC - Last-mile) 전 영역에 대한 깊은 이해&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile 운영 환경에서 Lean, Six Sigma(DMAIC) 방법론을 적용한 프로세스 개선 및 리딩 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우대&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;Data-driven 의사결정 및 SQL·BI Tool 활용에 대한 이해&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;Industrial Engineering, Business 등 물류 관련 전공 학사&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;IE(SCM, Operations Research, Quality), Business 석/박사&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;English business proficiency (Global 협업 필수)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형 절차 및&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;안내&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;절차&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;서류전형 - 직무 적합성 인터뷰 - 핵심 역량 인터뷰 – 최종 합격&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형절차는 직무별로 다르게 운영될 수 있으며, 일정 및 상황에 따라 변동될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형 일정 및 결과는 지원서에 등록하신 이메일로 개별 안내 드립니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;참고&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 공고는 모집 완료 시 조기 마감될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;지원서 내용 중 허위사실이 있는 경우에는 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;취업 보호 대상자(보훈대상자, 장애인 등)는 관련 법률에 따라 채용우대를 받을 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;직급과 담당 업무 범위는 후보자의 전반적인 경력과 경험 등 제반사정을 고려하여 변경될 수 있습니다. 이러한 변경이 필요할 경우, 최종 합격 통지 전 적절한 시기에 후보자와 커뮤니케이션 될 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;채용 및 업무 수행과 관련하여 요구되는 법령상 자격이 갖추어지지 않은 경우 채용이 제한될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;고용형태는 정규직으로 수습기간 12주를 포함합니다. 단, 업무상 필요한 경우에는 상기 수습기간을 적용하지 않거나 단축 또는 연장할 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;개인정보 처리방침&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;쿠팡 그룹은 입사지원자 개인정보 처리방침(아래 링크)에 따라 귀하의 개인정보를 수집하여 처리합니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;서류&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;반환 정책&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 고지는 『채용절차의공정화에관한법률』 제11조제6항에 따른 것 입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사 채용에 응시한 구직자 중 최종 합격이 되지 못한 구직자는 『채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률』에 따라 제출한 채용서류의 반환을 청구할 수 있음을 알려 드립니다. 다만, 홈페이지 또는 전자우편으로 제출된 경우나 구직자가 당사의 요구 없이 자발적으로 제출한 경우에는 그러하지 아니하며, 천재지변이나 그 밖에 당사에게 책임 없는 사유로 채용서류가 멸실된 경우에는 반환한 것으로 봅니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;위2항 본문에 따라 채용 서류 반환 청구를 하는 구직자는 채용 서류 반환 청구서 [채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률 시행규칙 별지 제 3 호 서식]를 작성하여 이메일 (&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitingops@coupang.com&quot;&gt;recruitingops@coupang.com&lt;/a&gt;) 로 제출하면, 제출이 확인된 날로부터 14 일 이내에 지정한 주소지로 등기우편을 통하여 발송해 드립니다. 이 경우 등기우편요금은 수신자 부담으로 하게 되오니 유념하시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사는 위2항 본문에 따른 구직자의 반환 청구에 대비하여 채용 여부가 확정된 날로부터 180 일간 구직자가 제출한 채용서류 원본을 보관하게 되며, 그때까지 채용서류의 반환을 청구하지 아니할 경우에는 『개인정보 보호법』에 따라 지체 없이 채용서류 일체를 파기할 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;단, 위 1항 내지 4항의 내용은 대한민국의 노동 관계 법령이 적용되는 경우에만 적용됩니다. 그 이외의 경우에는 적용되지 않습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;About the Role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is looking for a Director of Search Marketing to lead the search marketing portfolio and drive business performance across GMV, spend, efficiency, forecasting, and budget allocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior leadership role for a balanced performance marketing leader who combines strong commercial judgment with technical fluency. The ideal candidate understands search marketing at scale, can guide bidding and automation strategy, and can work effectively with engineering, ML, data science, and analytics teams. This leader will also manage a high-performing team and communicate search marketing performance clearly to senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Drive Search Marketing Business Performance&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead business performance for the search marketing portfolio across GMV, spend, efficiency, forecasting, and budget allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate company growth goals into channel-level targets, investment plans, and execution priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance growth, efficiency, spend constraints, and long-term channel health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Lead Channel Strategy and Execution&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee performance across major search and shopping platforms, including Naver and Google.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide strategy across Ads, Shopping, and other search-led growth surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set priorities across campaigns, keywords, placements, product/feed inputs, and optimization opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Advance Bidding, Measurement, and Automation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strong understanding of bidding frameworks, auction dynamics, automated bidding, ROAS, marginal ROI, and budget elasticity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with ML, engineering, data science, and analytics teams to improve bidding systems, measurement, forecasting, and diagnostics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to reduce manual work through automation, tooling, rules, and scalable operating processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Communicate and Influence Across the Business&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present performance, risks, tradeoffs, and recommendations clearly to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build concise, numbers-backed narratives that explain business performance and required actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Finance, Engineering, ML/Data Science, Analytics, Product, Legal, and external platform partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Lead and Develop the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of search marketing professionals responsible for channel and placement-level execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear goals, operating cadence, priorities, and accountability across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach the team to improve analytical depth, technical fluency, business judgment, and communication quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading search marketing, performance marketing, growth marketing, or paid media at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ownership of large-scale commercial outcomes such as GMV, revenue, spend, ROAS, ROI, margin, or equivalent business performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of search marketing mechanics, including bidding, auction dynamics, keyword strategy, budget allocation, shopping ads, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency sufficient to partner with and challenge engineering, ML, data science, and analytics teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to improve productivity through automation, tooling, process redesign, or scalable operating mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive communication skills, including the ability to explain numbers, defend tradeoffs, and influence senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing teams in a fast-paced, high-performance environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Korean and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing search marketing for a large ecommerce, marketplace, retail, technology, or consumer platform business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with Naver, Google, Kakao, or other major search, shopping, or digital advertising platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated bidding, ML-driven optimization, attribution, incrementality, feed-based advertising, or marketing data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing senior external platform relationships and negotiating for roadmap, beta access, data visibility, or commercial advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billiondollar e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing ecommerce companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurial surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is looking for a Taiwan-based Security Engineering Director to join our Digital Trust organization. Reporting to the CISO of Taiwan and Japan, this high-impact role requires a hands-on technical leader who balances strategic vision with tactical execution. You will drive the regulatory readiness and security requirements for Taiwan payment services, including potential electronic payment operations, while actively partnering on broader e-commerce and enterprise security initiatives across Taiwan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities will include, but not be limited to, the following:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives security readiness for Taiwan payment services — ensuring compliance with local standards and readiness for potential electronic payment license operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extends technical security leadership and engineering support beyond payments to assist broader e-commerce, logistics, and enterprise initiatives across Taiwan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as the key technical interface for local regulatory security audits and external partner assessments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor/Masters/PhDs in Computer Science or Engineering, Information Security or a related field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience working in the field of security engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep level of technical knowledge and hands-on experience in multiple security domains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in leading large scale security solutions involving cross function teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of Taiwan payment regulations (e.g., FSC security guidelines for electronic payment systems) and payment compliance frameworks (e.g., PCI-DSS v4.0)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual in Taiwanese Mandarin and English is preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors &amp;amp; Cultural Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable pivoting between rigorous payment regulatory compliance and fast-paced e-commerce business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy to make decisions in a rapidly growing company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial mind-set&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic mind-set and approach&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspirational leadership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong influencing and network capability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deals well with ambiguity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable getting into the detail&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts with pace and urgency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sees the bigger picture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen customer focus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and flexible&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process &amp;amp; Others &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruitment Process &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application Review - Phone Interview - Onsite (or Virtual Onsite) Interview – Offer &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The exact nature of the recruitment process may vary according to the specific job and may be changed due to scheduling or other circumstances. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview schedules and the results will be informed to the applicant via the e-mail address submitted at the application stage. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Details to Consider &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This job posting may be closed prior to the stated end date for application if all openings are filled.    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coupang has the right to rescind an offer of employment if a candidate is found to have submitted false information as part of the application process.    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coupang does not discriminate against disabled applicants or those with veteran status. We are proud to offer equal opportunities for all applicants. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Job titles and responsibilities may be subject to change depending on the candidate’s overall experience, etc. This will be communicated to the candidate at the appropriate time before the offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Privacy Notice &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/en/privacy-policy/&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Document Return Policy &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This notification is given pursuant to Article 11 (6) of the Fair Hiring Procedure Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A job applicant, who has applied but not been finally selected for a position at Coupang (the “Company”), may request the Company to return his/her hiring documents submitted pursuant to the Fair Hiring Procedure Act. However, this will not apply where the hiring documents were submitted via the website of the Company or e-mail, or where the job applicant submitted those documents voluntarily without a request from the Company. In addition, if the hiring documents were destroyed due to a natural disaster or any other reasons not attributable to the Company, such documents will be deemed to have been returned to the job applicant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A job applicant who wishes to request the return of his/her hiring documents pursuant to the main sentence of paragraph 2 above should fill out a “Request for Return of Hiring Documents” [Annex Form No. 3 in the Enforcement Rule of the Fair Hiring Procedure Act] and submit It by email (recruitingops@coupang.com). In such case, within fourteen (14) days from the date of identifying the receipt of the request, the Company will send the hiring documents to the job applicant’s designated address via registered mail. Please be informed that the job applicant is required to pay the postage on the registered mail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In preparation for a job applicant’s request for the return of hiring documents pursuant to the main sentence of paragraph 2 above, the Company shall retain the original hiring documents submitted by the job applicant for 180 days from the completion of the recruiting process. If no request is made until the end of this period, all his/her hiring documents will be destroyed immediately in accordance with the Personal Information Protection Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The above paragraphs 1 - 4 shall only apply when the labor-related laws of Korea govern the application. They are otherwise not applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did&amp;nbsp;I&amp;nbsp;ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we&amp;nbsp;are collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar commerce industry from the ground up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;and&amp;nbsp;establishing&amp;nbsp;an unparalleled reputation for being&amp;nbsp;leading&amp;nbsp;and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our&amp;nbsp;inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of&amp;nbsp;what’s&amp;nbsp;possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Role Overview &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Rocket Jikgu is Coupang&#39;s cross-border eCommerce business that enables customers in Korea to access millions of products from around the world through fast, reliable, and cost-effective delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Powered by our end-to-end global fulfillment network, Global eCommerce connects international sellers,&amp;nbsp;logistics&amp;nbsp;providers, and customers through an integrated supply chain ecosystem that delivers exceptional customer experiences at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our business continues to expand, we are seeking an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Director,&amp;nbsp;Global&amp;nbsp;SCM&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to lead strategic supply chain initiatives across our Global eCommerce organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Global SCM&lt;/strong&gt;, you will serve as the executive authority shaping the architecture, cost structure, and trade strategy and compliance of our international supply chain network. You will directly lead strategic network expansion, aggressive cost-out/VCPU improvements, high-impact program management, and cross-border trade strategies across primary markets, including Korea (import/export), Taiwan (import), US (export), EU (export), Japan (export), China (export), HK (export).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Global Logistics Network Planning (core requirement) &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Architect and own the long-term global network strategy, capacity modeling, and topology for Coupang’s end-to-end&amp;nbsp;cross-border&amp;nbsp;logistics&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;fulfillment network.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive cross-border infrastructure expansion roadmaps, optimizing linehaul routes, ocean/air freight networks, and destination last-mile integrations to support scale.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improve the PDD (Promised Delivery Date) and the consistency of the delivery &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish network governance models and throughput forecasting to systematically&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;capacity bottlenecks and enforce structural operational resilience.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Vendor Management &amp;amp; Strategic Partnerships&amp;nbsp;(core requirement)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Executive-level ownership of global vendor relationships across international carriers, freight forwarders, fulfillment partners, and customs brokerage networks.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish executive sponsorship frameworks and QBR standards with key global&amp;nbsp;logistics&amp;nbsp;partners to maximize service quality, accountability, and capacity commitments.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead strategic procurement strategy, key commercial contract negotiations, multi-year rate structures, and executive escalation protocols.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expand global&amp;nbsp;logistics&amp;nbsp;ecosystem by vetting and integrating emerging 3PL/4PL capabilities into existing supply chain assets.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Strategic Logistics Program Management&amp;nbsp;(core requirement)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initiate programs to increase speed (e.g.&amp;nbsp;PDD improvement, night-time custom clearance), lower cost (e.g.&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;shipback&amp;nbsp;center)&amp;nbsp;with innovative approach&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;large-scale, cross-functional supply chain transformations.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define program portfolio governance, high-level milestone structures, enterprise resource allocation, and risk-mitigation strategies.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive alignment across C-suite and VP-level stakeholders spanning Operations, Product, Tech, Procurement, and Finance to execute business-critical initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Cost Management, Billing &amp;amp; VCPU Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the global&amp;nbsp;logistics&amp;nbsp;P&amp;amp;L cost architecture,&amp;nbsp;establishing&amp;nbsp;target outcomes for Variable Cost Per Unit (VCPU) reduction across fulfillment, freight, and destination delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spearhead cross-functional cost-out steering committees to systematically&amp;nbsp;eliminate&amp;nbsp;financial waste,&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;container/load&amp;nbsp;utilization, and improve unit margin profiles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee multi-market billing audit controls, financial reconciliation systems, and vendor payables governance to protect bottom-line integrity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Global Trade Strategy &amp;amp; Trade Compliance (Korea &amp;amp; Taiwan)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set the strategic vision and regulatory governance for cross-border trade operations into core growth markets, specifically Korea and Taiwan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build enterprise-grade trade compliance models ensuring adherence to regional import/export mandates, tariff classifications, valuations, and customs policies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cultivate strategic engagement models with regulatory bodies and customs authorities in Korea and Taiwan to streamline border clearance throughput.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor global trade developments, tariff policies, and free-trade agreements to proactively&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;duty management and operational risk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
