&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in retail selection, catalog management, marketplace, search, recommendation, or product discovery products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with frontier AI technologies such as OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, or related LLM applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and mentoring Product Managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing products across multiple markets or international regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
