&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Six Sigma Green Belt or Black Belt certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a central or regional role overseeing multiple logistics sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL or data visualization tools like Tableau for independent performance tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in e-commerce fulfillment or last-mile logistics operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in international business expansion or global process standardization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
