&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5+ years experience in data, business analytics and other quantitative fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent skills in SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in English (nice to have as well)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of statistical analysis and algorithm design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in initiating and driving analytics projects and delivering actionable insights and recommendations to business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with stakeholders in requirement identification and final delivery for features and analytical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
