&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Coupang&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is one of the world’s fastest-growing e-commerce platforms, redefining the customer experience through technology and operational excellence. In Taiwan, Coupang is rapidly expanding its retail business, focused on delivering best-in-class selection, pricing, and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Retail Business Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a key role in driving data-driven decision-making across Coupang Taiwan’s retail organization. You will partner closely with Merchandising, Pricing, Supply Chain, and Operations teams to analyze performance, identify growth opportunities, and optimize business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires strong analytical capabilities, business acumen, and the ability to translate complex data into actionable insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Performance &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze retail KPIs including sales, margin, inventory turns, and customer behavior to identify trends and performance gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide actionable insights to improve category growth, profitability, and operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dashboards and reports to monitor daily/weekly/monthly business performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing &amp;amp; Promotion Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pricing strategy through competitive benchmarking and elasticity analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate promotional effectiveness and ROI, recommending improvements for future campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with merchandising teams to optimize assortment and pricing decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory &amp;amp; Supply Chain Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze inventory health, demand forecasting accuracy, and replenishment efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify risks such as stockouts and overstock, and propose mitigation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with supply chain teams to improve operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic initiatives such as new category launches, vendor performance analysis, or market expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive analyses to identify growth opportunities and operational improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop business cases and present recommendations to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Stakeholder Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Merchants, Operations, Finance, and Tech teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business requirements into data solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate insights effectively to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Economics, Statistics, Engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in business analytics, consulting, e-commerce, or retail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Excel and SQL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large datasets and building dashboards (e.g., Tableau, Power BI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in e-commerce or fast-paced retail environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with pricing, merchandising, or supply chain analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in other data analytic tools (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills in &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; (highly preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, ambiguous environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder management and communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agility and adaptability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
