&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did I ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar commerce industry from the ground up. We are an American technology company and one of the fastest-growing retail companies that has established an unparalleled reputation for being a leading and reliable force in global commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurial, surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a strategic thinker and exceptional operator who is passionate about technology and cloud computing. This individual will partner with business leaders to influence investment decisions, evaluate growth opportunities, improve operational performance, and drive financial excellence. Success in this role requires both executive-level strategic thinking and deep attention to operational detail, with a genuine curiosity for the economics, technologies, and business drivers shaping the future of cloud and AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is well-suited for candidates from investment banking, leading technology companies, management consulting, corporate finance, or high-growth technology startups who have demonstrated strong business judgment, ownership, attention to detail, and execution discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates should possess a strong interest in cloud computing, AI, and cloud infrastructure. Experience supporting cloud, infrastructure, platform, SaaS, data center, AI, or other technology businesses is highly valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial modeling, forecasting, and analytical capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance strategic thinking with operational execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and commitment to high-quality deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing planning, forecasting, business reviews, and executive reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity for cloud computing, AI, and infrastructure economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex technical and business concepts into actionable financial insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business and engineering leaders on investment decisions, resource allocation, and cloud strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate TCO, ROI, build-versus-buy decisions, and other strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop financial models and business cases to support growth and long-term planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead forecasting, budgeting, planning, and business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
