&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Licensed attorney in Taiwan, or a foreign‑qualified lawyer with substantial experience practicing in Taiwan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Minimum of&amp;nbsp;5 years of post‑qualification legal experience, including experience either in a law firm or as in‑house counsel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
