&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as&amp;nbsp;stated&amp;nbsp;in the Application Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;located&amp;nbsp;below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&quot;&gt;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
