&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of AI and Large Language Models (LLMs) and how they can be leveraged to enhance Customer Experience, review ecosystems, and conversion rates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
