&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Hands-on technical proficiency with data visualization, reporting tools, SQL, and Tableau&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mandarin or Korean language skills are a strong plus to facilitate seamless communication with cross-border teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
