&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end logistics programs across first-, middle-, and last-mile; define scope, OKRs, and drive execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;Manage KR→TW report transition and build unified end-to-end visibility.• Improve PDD and operational performance by removing defects and bottlenecks with LOC, hubs, linehaul, and sortation teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;Build dashboards (Tableau/Power BI) and turn insights into actions, owners, and SOP changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Finance, and hubs to solve problems and deliver structured recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;Run simulations for network, volume, and cut-off changes to guide data-based decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;Identify risks, execute mitigation, and manage communication and change adoption.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
