&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This job posting may be closed prior to the stated end date for application if all openings are filled.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coupang has the right to rescind an offer of employment if a candidate is found to have submitted false information as part of the application process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coupang does not discriminate against disabled applicants or those with veteran status. We are proud to offer equal opportunities for all applicants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as&amp;nbsp;stated in the Application Privacy Notice located&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://rocketyourcareer.usa.coupang.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;HERE&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Document Return Policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This notification is given pursuant to Article 11 (6) of the Fair Hiring Procedure Act.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A job applicant, who has applied but not been finally selected for a position at Coupang (the “&lt;strong&gt;Company&lt;/strong&gt;”), may request the Company to return his/her hiring documents submitted pursuant to the Fair Hiring Procedure Act.&amp;nbsp; However, this will not apply where the hiring documents were submitted via the website of the Company or e-mail, or where the job applicant submitted those documents voluntarily without a request from the Company.&amp;nbsp; In addition, if the hiring documents were destroyed due to a natural disaster or any other reasons not attributable to the Company, such documents will be deemed to have been returned to the job applicant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A job applicant who wishes to request the return of his/her hiring documents pursuant to the main sentence of paragraph 2 above should fill out a “Request for Return of Hiring Documents” [Annex Form No. 3 in the Enforcement Rule of the Fair Hiring Procedure Act] and submit the request to the Company by email (&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitingops@coupang.com&quot;&gt;recruitingops@coupang.com&lt;/a&gt;) In such case, within fourteen (14) days from the date of identifying the receipt of the request, the Company will send the hiring documents to the job applicant’s designated address via registered mail.&amp;nbsp; Please be informed that the job applicant is required to pay the postage on the registered mail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In preparation for a job applicant’s request for the return of hiring documents pursuant to the main sentence of paragraph 2 above, the Company shall retain the original hiring documents submitted by the job applicant for 180 days from the completion of the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp; If no request is made until the end of this period, all of his/her hiring documents will be destroyed immediately in accordance with the Personal Information Protection Act.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The above paragraphs 1 - 4 shall only apply when the labor-related laws of Korea govern the application. They are otherwise not applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities for All&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is an equal opportunity employer. Our unprecedented success could not be possible without the valuable inputs of our globally diverse team.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal, Tech Executive Recruiter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary:&lt;/strong&gt; Join Coupang as a Principal, Tech Executive Recruiter, and play a critical role in identifying and hiring the next generation of technology leaders. This role requires partnering with senior executives across various geographies to build world-class talent pipelines and drive best recruitment practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with senior internal customers to understand their hiring needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Devise and carry out a targeted global search strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build global executive talent pipelines through direct sourcing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive recruitment intelligence using our internal CRM platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attract top-tier technical talent to South Korea, Singapore, India and US with tenacity and determination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present an exceptional company pitch to potential candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess candidates for qualification match, cultural fit, and compatibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence at the offer stage, articulating Coupang’s career vision and compensation philosophy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Global Mobility Team to facilitate candidate relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance the overall recruitment process and implement best practices organization-wide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree and 8+ years of experience in full-cycle recruiting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a tier-1 internet company or high-growth challenger brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical thinker adept in a global, fast-paced, data-driven, and entrepreneurial culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven sound business judgment with the ability to communicate and influence effectively, including at the executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capability to think strategically while managing tactical execution in an agile environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Trust and Safety team at Coupang is responsible for curbing fraud and abuse and thereby improving customer and sellers trust on the platform, while ensuring that genuine customers/ sellers get the best of experiences. Trust and Safety team develops policies and standards, provides appropriate guidance, and helps to implement and monitor controls to identify and mitigate risks across the platform. The team partners with business and operations to design products, services and controls which reduce fraud and risk vulnerabilities, and govern the process by measuring, monitoring, and reporting fraud risks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy Development: Develop and execute the overall Trust and Safety strategy aligned with the company&#39;s compliance vision to mitigate risk, address abuse, and foster a safe and supportive space for our customers. Stay&amp;nbsp;up-to-date&amp;nbsp;with industry trends and emerging threats to proactively&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;potential risks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Policy Development:&amp;nbsp;Establish&amp;nbsp;and update policies, guidelines, and standards related to trust and safety to improve overall risk and compliance outcomes. Ensure compliance with relevant laws, regulations, and industry standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detection and Prevention: Implement robust systems and protocols to detect and prevent fraudulent activities by sellers/suppliers including counterfeits, IP&amp;nbsp;infringement across the platform. Utilize data-driven insights and analytics to improve detection methods continually.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: Collaborate with product, engineering, legal, and customer support teams to integrate trust and safety measures into the platform&#39;s design and functionalities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident Response and Investigation: Oversee the investigation of reported incidents, coordinate with relevant teams, and take&amp;nbsp;appropriate actions&amp;nbsp;to resolve issues promptly while&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;transparency with affected parties.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance and Reporting: Monitor and report on trust and safety metrics, compliance, and performance indicators. Provide regular updates to the executive team and stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Improvement: Drive a culture of continuous improvement, innovation, and excellence within the Trust and Safety team with key focus on automation and systems development for identification of trust and safety issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a relevant field; advanced degree preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 10 years of experience in Trust and Safety, Risk Management, Fraud&amp;nbsp;Controls&amp;nbsp;or related fields.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of successfully managing trust and safety operations in a high-volume eCommerce environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of industry best practices, compliance requirements, and global regulations related to user safety, privacy, and fraud prevention.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership and team management skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven decision-making skills and the ability to analyze complex data sets to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;patterns and trends.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and interpersonal skills to effectively collaborate with internal and external stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in crisis management and incident response.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and adaptable, with a strong ability to thrive in a fast-paced and rapidly changing eCommerce environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Recruitment Process and Others &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
