&lt;p&gt;ご応募に際してご提供いただく個人情報は、以下のプライバシーポリシーに基づき、Coupangが収集・管理いたします：https://www.coupang.jobs/jp/privacy-policy/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;機会均等&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupangは、多様で包括的な職場を目指しています。Coupangは機会均等雇用者です。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Rocket Now&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rocket Now is a food delivery service with no delivery or service fees. Consumers can enjoy a wide variety of cuisines, from Japanese and Western food to healthy options, as well as desserts and drinks, quickly and affordably. The service is currently available mainly in Hokkaido, Tohoku (Sendai), Kanto (Tokyo, Kanagawa, Saitama, Chiba), Chubu (Aichi,Shizuoka), Kansai (Osaka, Kyoto, Hyogo), Hiroshima, and Kyushu (Fukuoka). Rocket Now won the Excellence Award in the Shopping Category at the Best App Awards 2025. Furthermore, it has achieved the No. 1 ranking in the Food Delivery App category for nine consecutive months on both the iOS and Android app stores (*1), and the app continues to grow, surpassing 5 million downloads in just 15 months since its launch (*2). *1 Based on integrated iOS and Android data from July 2025 to March 2026. *2 As of January 14, 2025, service release date (Source: Global Market Intelligence: Sensor Tower)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CP One Japan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CP One Japan LLC is the Japanese subsidiary of Coupang, Inc. (NYSE: CPNG), a US-based company listed on the NYSE (New York Stock Exchange) and one of the Fortune 150 companies, known as a technology company. CP One Japan operates the &quot;Rocket Now&quot; brand food delivery service in Japan, leveraging Coupang&#39;s technological capabilities and innovative logistics solutions to provide fast, reliable, and customer-oriented food delivery services to Japanese consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Overseas” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Procurement Director to lead strategic sourcing and supplier management for Automation Categories across Coupang&#39;s rapidly expanding fulfillment and logistics network. This leader will own category strategies for warehouse automation, robotics, material handling equipment (MHE), sortation systems, industrial controls, conveyor systems, and related technology infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will drive cost optimization, supplier innovation, risk mitigation, and long-term procurement strategies that support Coupang&#39;s operational excellence and growth objectives&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category Strategy &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute multi-year category strategies for automation-related spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage procurement activities across robotics, automated storage and retrieval systems (ASRS), conveyor and sortation systems, warehouse control systems, industrial automation, sensors, and related technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align sourcing strategies with Operations, Engineering, Fulfillment, Supply Chain, Finance, and Capital Projects teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build procurement roadmaps supporting network expansion and automation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-value sourcing events, RFIs, RFPs, RFQs, and contract negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver measurable savings, total cost of ownership (TCO) improvements, and value creation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate global and regional suppliers for capability, quality, scalability, and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive supplier consolidation where appropriate while ensuring business continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Relationship Management&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish executive-level relationships with key automation suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead supplier performance reviews and governance programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategic partnerships that accelerate innovation and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage supplier risk, capacity planning, and business continuity strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Contract Management&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate complex commercial agreements, framework contracts, maintenance agreements, and service-level commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure favorable terms regarding pricing, warranties, service support, intellectual property, and performance guarantees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal and Finance teams to manage contract compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Engineering and Operations teams on automation deployment projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support capital expenditure planning and procurement governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive procurement involvement from project conception through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence stakeholders across multiple business units and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing category management team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish procurement best practices, processes, and performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a data-driven and customer-focused culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree with 15+ years of progressive experience in procurement, with at least 7 years in infrastructure categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen, negotiation skills, and contract management expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing global teams and multi-region supplier portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in procurement platforms (e.g., SAP Ariba, Coupa) and data analytics tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding Leadership and Management Skills: Excellent problem-solving, team, and time management skills, with the ability to evaluate and counsel subordinates effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional Negotiation and Analytical Abilities: Strong reputation as a negotiator, leading complex agreements with suppliers, and deep understanding of cost drivers and cost models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic and Results-Oriented Leadership: Known for employing fact-based analysis, world-class process expertise, and leading by example to achieve breakthrough performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Experience and Executive Presence: Significant executive presence, ability to represent the organization effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
