&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;31&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did&amp;nbsp;I&amp;nbsp;ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we&amp;nbsp;are collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar commerce industry from the ground up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;and&amp;nbsp;establishing&amp;nbsp;an unparalleled reputation for being&amp;nbsp;leading&amp;nbsp;and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our&amp;nbsp;inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of&amp;nbsp;what’s&amp;nbsp;possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Global Operations Technology organization is responsible for the systems that enable Coupang to reliably deliver to customers within hours of order placement. Our mission is to transform logistics by building a highly efficient delivery network at unprecedented scale and speed.&lt;br&gt;We are seeking an experienced and passionate &lt;strong&gt;Project Assistant&lt;/strong&gt; who can partner closely with directors and leadership teams to drive execution across the organization and beyond. The ideal candidate will support directors in planning, coordinating, and executing programs that enable teams to build innovative systems and features that delight our customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide administrative support to multiple Global Operations Technology leaders, including complex calendar management across international time zones, travel coordination, expense management, and other executive support activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and manage small- to medium-scale administrative projects across a variety of functional areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ad hoc operational activities in a timely and accurate manner, including processing organizational changes and maintaining related systems and records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and coordinate internal events, managing event logistics in collaboration with internal stakeholders and external vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate effective communication and coordination across teams to support organizational priorities and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high level of professionalism, discretion, and confidentiality when handling sensitive information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, resourceful, and solution-oriented mindset with a strong sense of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities and meet deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and commitment to accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle confidential information with a high degree of integrity and professionalism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in project coordination, executive assistance, administrative support, or process management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong computer literacy with proficiency in Microsoft Office applications and collaboration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in spoken and written English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting senior leaders or working in a technology-driven organization is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
