&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop data-driven recommendations that enhance customer satisfaction and reduce customer-impacting defects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/h3&gt;
