&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This role supports our Rocket Fulfillment Center (RFC) operations team based in Taoyuan and follows a hybrid work model, requiring a minimum of three days per week onsite. As a Finance Business Partner, you will work closely with Operations leaders to monitor financial and operational performance, deliver actionable insights through data analysis, support planning and forecasting processes, and help drive initiatives that improve cost efficiency, productivity, and customer experience across the fulfillment network.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
