&lt;div&gt;The Finance team serves as a strategic business partner to the Rocket Fulfillment Center (RFC) organization. We own financial outcomes by partnering closely with Operations leaders to define, track, and improve key business metrics across the fulfillment network. As a Principal, Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis (FP&amp;amp;A), you will drive budgeting and forecasting processes, identify opportunities to optimize costs and productivity, conduct deep-dive analyses to solve complex business challenges, and develop scalable reporting and automation solutions that support operational excellence and informed decision-making.&lt;/div&gt;
