&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver GMV goal and help Kitchen category growth with Rocket Growth Model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate and execute regional merchants recruiting strategies for designated fashion categories/sub-categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage relationships with merchants to drive business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze merchant performance data and develop tailored growth strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve merchants&#39; pain points through high-impact projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long-term relationships with merchants, ensuring high levels of merchants’ satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams to align business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of sales, business development, category management or account management experience, Kitchen category experience is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
