&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design, develop and improve automated reports and dashboards to measure performance and support business needs around Pricing Performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pull and leverage data to provide proactive, actionable insights that can identify growth opportunities, increase efficiency, and/or deepen understanding of business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and maintain database to house audit results for reporting and analysis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate and partner with BA and Data Science teams in Finance and Pricing to incorporate Price Audit data into broader analysis and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set strategic and measurable goals, define new metrics and collaborate with other teams to achieve success on cross-team projects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Become a subject matter expert in areas concerning pricing and audit&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
