&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and detail-oriented&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with a background in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;e-commerce and marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to coordinate and manage external partnerships, including partner banks and other strategic collaborators. This role will be instrumental in driving payment-related campaigns and promotional initiatives, working closely with internal and external stakeholders to ensure seamless execution and maximum visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage day-to-day communication and collaboration with partner banks and external business partners for monthly and campaign-specific promotions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initiate and execute promotional campaigns and online/offline collaborations with external partners and merchants to drive GMV and enhance brand awareness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate closely with Brand Management, Marketing, CRM, PR, and Customer Service teams to ensure smooth campaign execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee timely launch of promotions with flawless operational flow and strong in-app and off-platform exposure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage external media agencies for campaign-related promotional activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Configure and maintain payment-related offers, including credit card BIN pool management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support system updates related to payment features and ensure proper maintenance and functionality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Marketing, Business, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3–5 years of experience in e-commerce, digital marketing, or financial partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong project management skills and ability to communicate effectively with stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with the payment ecosystem (e.g., credit cards, digital wallets) is preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytical mindset with strong attention to detail and ability to manage multiple campaigns simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Native proficiency in Chinese and fluency in English (spoken and written)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
