&lt;li&gt;Conduct site inspections and verification, including the review of major electrical equipment specifications (e.g., switchgear and distribution panels), inspection of electrical installations, and preparation of punch lists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage electrical-related issues, including developing improvement plans for power capacity shortages and coordinating with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
