&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creator Acquisition &amp;amp; Partner Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, recruit, and onboard KOLs and KOCs across platforms including Instagram, YouTube, TikTok, and Threads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with creators, MCNs, talent agencies, and affiliate partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduce creators to platform partnership opportunities and educate them on the value and growth potential of joining the Coupang ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive creator engagement and retention through ongoing communication, support, and relationship management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute creator growth initiatives to help creators maximize their performance and earnings potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affiliate Platform &amp;amp; Commission Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day operations of the affiliate platform, monitoring creator and partner traffic, conversions, and revenue performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee affiliate campaign execution, including campaign setup, tracking implementation, performance monitoring, and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and execution of commission-based programs, including CPS (Cost Per Sale), CPA (Cost Per Action), and revenue-sharing models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze affiliate tracking data, conversion funnels, traffic quality, and ROI, and provide actionable recommendations for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Operations, and Analytics teams to enhance platform functionality and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor industry trends and competitor activities to identify opportunities for creator incentives, promotional programs, and platform growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign &amp;amp; Platform Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the execution of influencer marketing and affiliate marketing campaigns from launch through completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with creators to ensure content is delivered on time and complies with campaign requirements and guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track campaign progress and proactively identify and resolve operational issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for creators throughout the partnership lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign performance and provide operational insights to support future optimization efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contracting, Commission &amp;amp; Payment Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate contract execution, documentation, and onboarding processes with creators and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure campaign deliverables, conversion performance, and operational results are accurately tracked and recorded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage commission calculation, validation, and revenue-sharing settlement processes for creators and affiliate partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support monthly payment processing, reconciliation, and payout operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance, Legal, and other stakeholders to ensure compliance with internal policies, payment procedures, and contractual obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Data Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve creator experience, partner satisfaction, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and optimize Affiliate Program SOPs, Creator Lifecycle Management processes, and scalable operational frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain creator databases, campaign tracking tools, and performance reporting dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data insights to identify growth opportunities and implement operational best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Influencer Marketing, Affiliate Marketing, Creator Operations, Partnership Management, Digital Marketing, E-commerce Marketing, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing influencer marketing campaigns and creator partnerships within the Taiwan market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Affiliate Marketing, Creator Economy, and Performance Marketing business models and key success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management, communication, and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Excel, Google Sheets, CRM systems, and reporting or campaign tracking tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and project management skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly detail-oriented, proactive, and adaptable in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Affiliate Platforms, Affiliate Networks, Creator Commerce, or social commerce ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and managing commission structures, revenue-sharing programs, or creator incentive programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with affiliate tracking and partnership platforms such as Impact, Partnerize, CJ Affiliate, Rakuten Advertising, or similar solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;CRM Marketing experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in contract administration, commission settlement, invoicing, and payment operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with a data-driven mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for creator partnerships, affiliate business development, and platform growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
