&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;​&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysts on the TW Logistics Analytics team&lt;/strong&gt; are responsible for understanding and improving the entire customer delivery journey—from order placement to final delivery (last-mile logistics)—through data-driven insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, they:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain data infrastructure, including pipelines, data mart tables, and dashboards, to ensure stakeholders have access to accurate and timely data when they need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data accuracy, consistency, and reliability through validation, backfilling, and governance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive analyses to identify root causes behind operational issues and uncover actionable opportunities for improvement, going beyond surface-level metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering, Product, and Operations teams to develop innovative analytical approaches that enable insights and capabilities that were previously not possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;End-to-End Delivery Operations Analytics&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and monitor key KPIs related to the delivery network, delivery status, and courier operations, and identify the root causes of operational issues through data-driven analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and analyze operational metrics such as delivery success rate, delivery lead time, and courier productivity, uncover improvement opportunities, and support data-driven decision-making within the Operations organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;New Project Simulation &amp;amp; Pre-/Post-Launch Analysis&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate the impact of new initiatives, such as route optimization and network redesign, through rigorous pre- and post-launch data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design simulation frameworks and provide accurate, actionable insights to help decision-makers make informed business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Data Infrastructure &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain the data pipelines (Airflow DAGs) and data mart tables (Hive/Presto) that serve as the foundation for delivery-domain analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data integrity and reliability through validation, backfilling, and governance processes, while maintaining a trusted data ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;KPI Reporting &amp;amp; Stakeholder Communication&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage business reports and dashboards for leadership teams and key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate analytical findings clearly and concisely to diverse audiences, fostering a data-driven decision-making culture across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Managers, Program Managers, Engineers, and Operations teams to translate business questions into analytical frameworks and deliver timely, actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience analyzing large-scale datasets using SQL (Presto/Hive).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing data ETL processes and orchestrating data pipelines (e.g., Airflow).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building dashboards and business reports using tools such as Tableau, Power BI, or Zeppelin.&lt;/li&gt;
