&lt;p&gt;Coupang 正在重新構想購物體驗，目標是讓每位顧客從打開 Coupang 應用程式起至訂單送達家門的每一刻都驚嘆不已。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我們在台灣的包括「火箭速配」，以實惠的價格為多種精選商品提供隔日到貨服務。「火箭跨境」供應來自韓國、美國等地數百萬種暢銷商品，並提供國際速配服務。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我們正在尋覓人才協助我們帶領 Coupang 台灣拓展業務。這是個難得的機會，一同參與 Coupang 在台灣的成長，打造一個讓我們的顧客自問「沒有 Coupang，我該怎麼過活？」的世界。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position Summary&lt;br&gt;負責 HR 流程標準化、自動化及資料品質管理，透過流程優化、系統改善及數據治理提升 HR 營運效率、準確性及組織生產力。此職位隸屬於 Planning &amp;amp; System Team，直接向 Riana 匯報，並作為 HQ HRM 流程改善與自動化的重要推動者。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;分析並優化 HR 流程，建立標準化作業模式&lt;br&gt;規劃並推動 HR 流程改善與自動化專案，持續提升營運效率及資料準確性&lt;br&gt;管理及提升 HR 資料品質與準確性&lt;br&gt;改善 Payroll、Attendance、Recruiting 等核心 HR 流程&lt;br&gt;主導跨部門 HR 改善專案&lt;br&gt;推動 HQ 與 Site 間作業模式標準化&lt;br&gt;與 HR 各功能團隊合作，推動流程改善、自動化及數據品質提升&lt;br&gt;建立 Dashboard 與 KPI 監控機制&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;br&gt;5 年以上 Recruiting or HR or Process Improvement 或相關領域經驗&lt;br&gt;熟悉 HRIS、Payroll、Attendance 及 Recruiting 流程&lt;br&gt;具備數據分析及問題解決能力&lt;br&gt;具備專案管理經驗&lt;br&gt;熟悉 Excel、Power BI 及 Python&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;br&gt;具 Process Improvement、Lean 或 Continuous Improvement 經驗&lt;br&gt;熟悉 Power Automate、SQL、AI 工具應用&lt;br&gt;具大型營運組織或 Shared Service 經驗&lt;br&gt;具跨部門專案管理及變革推動經驗&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;招募流程&lt;br&gt;申請審核 - 視訊面試 - 錄取通知書&lt;br&gt;招聘流程的確切性質可能會根據具體工作而有所不同，並且可能會因日程安排或其他情況而發生變化。&lt;br&gt;面試時間表和結果將透過電子郵件地址通知應徵人員。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;需要考慮的事項&lt;br&gt;如果空缺職位已填補，則此職位發布可能會在規定的申請結束日期之前關閉。&lt;br&gt;如果發現候選人在申請過程中提交了虛假信息，Coupang 有權撤銷聘用邀請。&lt;br&gt;Coupang 不歧視殘疾申請人或退伍軍人。 我們很自豪能為所有申請人提供平等的機會。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;人人均等的機會&lt;br&gt;Coupang提供均等的機會給所有員工。若沒有全球多元團隊的寶貴意見，我們不可能達成史無前例的成功。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did I ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we are collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar commerce industry from the ground up&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;and establishing an unparalleled reputation for being leading and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Role Overview &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior IT Internal Auditor at Coupang will lead and support global IT risk and control evaluations for Internal Controls over Financial Reporting (ICFR / US SOX) as well as complex IT operational areas. This role requires a tech-forward auditor who leverages data analytics, workflow automation, and AI-driven tools to enhance continuous auditing, evaluate enterprise cybersecurity postures, and deliver high-impact risk insights across Coupang’s cloud-native and engineering environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICFR &amp;amp; Compliance Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute reviews of internal control documentation,&amp;nbsp;technical Risk and Control Matrices (RCM), and remediation blueprints in accordance with US&amp;nbsp;SOX, US GAAP, PCAOB, and local Korean compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global IT Risk &amp;amp; Controls Assessment:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive risk assessments and technical control&amp;nbsp;evaluations across major enterprise systems, cloud architecture (AWS/GCP), containerized&amp;nbsp;applications, and infrastructure. Evaluate impacts on financial reporting as well as IT&amp;nbsp;operational security, Data Privacy (PIPA), Disaster Recovery, and cyber threat vectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Audit Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute technical testing of IT General Controls&amp;nbsp;(ITGCs), automated application controls, API integrations, identity and access management&amp;nbsp;(IAM), and system-generated key reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Automation Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and assist in the implementation of opportunities to&amp;nbsp;automate routine audit workflows and integrate Generative AI / LLM tools for audit&lt;br&gt;documentation, code reviews, script generation, and control testing enhancement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; External Audit Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Communicate technical risk findings clearly to Internal Audit Leadership and business/engineering stakeholders. Coordinate technical testing scopes with external auditors to maximize leverage and optimize audit efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Technical Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Information Security, DevOps,&amp;nbsp;Engineering, Financial Controls, and IT Compliance teams to identify control gaps, perform&amp;nbsp;root-cause analysis, and oversee engineering remediation through closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, Management Information System,&amp;nbsp;Accounting, Cybersecurity, Data Analytics, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: Minimum of 3 - 5 years of IT audit, cybersecurity audit, or IT risk consulting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications: At least one active professional certification: CISA, CISSP, CRISC, CISM, CIA, or AWS/GCP Cloud Certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language Proficiency: Bilingual fluency in English and Korean (spoken, written, and technical&amp;nbsp;reading/writing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working in a fast-paced U.S.- listed tech/e-commerce company or Big 4 IT&amp;nbsp;risk advisory practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience auditing microservices architectures, CI/CD pipelines, containerization&amp;nbsp;(Kubernetes, Docker), or cloud environments (AWS/GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing continuous auditing scripts or machine learning models for fraud and&amp;nbsp;anomaly detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of IT internal control frameworks (COBIT, NIST CSF, ISO 27001, SOC 1/SOC.&amp;nbsp;2, CIS Benchmarks) and strong hands-on experience evaluating ITGCs, cloud security&amp;nbsp;configurations, and identity governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL, Python, R, or advanced analytics platforms (Tableau, Power BI, Alteryx) to&amp;nbsp;extract, transform, and analyze large-scale datasets directly from databases (PostgreSQL,&amp;nbsp;MySQL, Snowflake, BigQuery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with audit automation frameworks (RPA, script-driven testing) and practical&amp;nbsp;exposure to leveraging AI/ML tools (e.g., LLMs, prompt engineering, automated code&amp;nbsp;analysis) to streamline audit workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; ability to articulate complex technical risk&amp;nbsp;scenarios to non-technical stakeholders and defend audit findings constructively under&amp;nbsp;challenge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing multi-threaded technical audit engagements in fast-paced&amp;nbsp;e-commerce or tech environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
