&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;회사 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡은 고객 감동 실현을 위해 존재합니다. 고객들이 &quot;쿠팡 없이 그동안 어떻게 살았을까?&quot; 라고 말할 때, 비로소 우리의 미션을 실현하고 있음을 알 수 있습니다. 고객들의 쇼핑과 식사, 생활 전반을 편하게 만들겠다는 유일한 집념으로 쿠팡은 수억 달러 규모의 이커머스 산업 전반의 혁신을 이끌고 있습니다. 쿠팡은 가장 빠르게 성장하는 이커머스 기업 중 하나로, 국내 커머스 업계에서의 독보적인 입지와, 고객 신뢰를 구축했습니다.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡은 스타트업 문화를 기반으로 한 글로벌 대형 상장사라고 자부합니다. 이것이 창립 당시의 기민함을 유지하며, 신규 서비스를 끊임없이 출시하며 비즈니스를 확장해 나가는 우리의 성장 동력입니다. 쿠팡의 모든 임직원에게는 기업가 정신을 갖추고 새로운 혁신과 이니셔티브를 추진할 수 있는 기회가 주어집니다. 주저 없이 일에 뛰어들어 성과를 이루고자 하는 과감성이, 바로 쿠팡이 일하는 방식의 본질입니다. 쿠팡에서는&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;여러분 자신, 동료, 팀 그리고 회사 전체가 매일 성장하는 모습을 목격할 것입니다.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡의 모든 직원은 커머스의 미래를 만들겠다는 쿠팡의 미션에 진심입니다. 우리는 고객의 문제를 해결해 나가고, 전통적인 관념과 통념에 맞서며 실현 가능한 한계를 뛰어넘고 있습니다. 고가용성 (always-on) 과 최첨단의 앞선 기술 (high-tech), 초연결사회 (hyper-connected world) 에서의 놀라운 업무 경험을 원하신다면, 지금 바로 쿠팡에 합류하세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;팀 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catalog Engineering 조직의 Operational Intelligence 팀은 방대한 규모의 상품 카탈로그 데이터와 최첨단 AI 기술, 그리고 백엔드 시스템을 연결하여 쿠팡의 카탈로그 운영을 자동화하고 지능화하는 핵심 시스템을 개발합니다. 상품 정보의 정확도 검증, 카탈로그 데이터 정제 및 정규화, 엔티티 매핑 등 복잡한 운영 의사결정을 자율적으로 수행하는 대규모 AI 시스템을 다룹니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;거대한 비즈니스 임팩트: 작성한 모델과 에이전트 알고리즘이 매일 수백만 건의 카탈로그 데이터를 직접 처리하며, 쿠팡의 커머스 에코시스템 전반의 데이터 품질과 운영 효율성을 혁신합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;풍부한 계산 자원 및 최첨단 연구 환경: 대규모 GPU 클러스터 인프라 지원을 바탕으로 Agentic Training, 최신 파인튜닝, 멀티모달 연구 등 선도적인 AI 기술을 마음껏 시도할 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;글로벌 기술 협업: 서울, 시애틀, 베이징, 상하이, 실리콘밸리 등 전 세계 우수한 엔지니어 및 데이터 과학자들과 함께 일하며 깊이 있는 기술적 성장을 이룰 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;자율과 혁신의 문화: 주도적인 문제 해결과 빠른 시도, 실패를 통한 배움을 장려하는 기그(Geek) 정신 중심의 문화를 지향합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;업무 내용&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;본 포지션은 &lt;strong&gt;Agentic 애플리케이션의 데이터 사이언스, 모델링 및 알고리즘 영역에 집중하는 AI/ML 엔지니어&lt;/strong&gt;입니다. 백엔드 엔지니어 및 플랫폼 엔지니어와 긴밀히 협력하여 자율형 에이전트(Autonomous Agents) 및 다중 에이전트(Multi-Agent) 워크플로우를 설계하고 고도화하는 역할을 담당합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;데이터 사이언스 &amp;amp; 알고리즘 R&amp;amp;D:&lt;/strong&gt; 카탈로그 운영 에이전트를 위한 LLM/ML 모델을 설계, 학습 및 최적화합니다. 툴 라우팅(Tool Routing), 서브 에이전트 오케스트레이션 알고리즘, 검색 증강 생성(RAG), 추론 프레임워크(ReAct, Chain-of-Thought, Agentic RL 등) 연구 및 적용을 주도합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;도메인 특화 LLM 파인튜닝:&lt;/strong&gt; 상품 속성 추출, 카탈로그 정규화, 엔티티 로지컬 매핑, 규정 준수 감사 등 카탈로그 도메인 특화 데이터셋을 기반으로 SFT(Supervised Fine-Tuning) 및 RLHF/RLAIF(강화학습) 모델 파인튜닝 전 과정을 주도합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;데이터 피드백 루프 &amp;amp; 평가 체계 구축:&lt;/strong&gt; 운영 전문가(Human-in-the-loop)의 피드백 데이터를 활용하여 고신뢰도 학습 데이터셋을 구축하고, 모델의 추론 성능 및 운영 지표를 지속적으로 향상시키는 데이터 플라이휠(Data Flywheel)과 평가 시스템(LLM-as-a-judge 등)을 설계합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;크로스 스쿼드 협업 (AI &amp;amp; 백엔드):&lt;/strong&gt; 고성능 분산 인프라 및 에이전트 실행 엔진을 담당하는 백엔드 엔지니어와 긴밀히 협력합니다. ML 엔지니어로서 프롬프트 엔지니어링, 데이터 큐레이션, 알고리즘 로직 및 평가 체계를 전담하며, 낮은 지연 시간(Low Latency)의 툴 호출(Tool-calling) 인터페이스 규격을 함께 정의합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;멀티모달 카탈로그 인텔리전스:&lt;/strong&gt; 텍스트, 이미지, 수치형 데이터를 통합 처리하는 멀티모달 LLM 기술을 활용하여 랜드마크 브랜드 검증, 중복 상품 통합, 미흡 속성 자동 채우기 등 고도화된 카탈로그 운영 자동화를 구현합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;자격&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;요건&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;컴퓨터 과학, 인공지능, 머신러닝, 데이터 사이언스 또는 이와 유사한 관련 전공 분야의 &lt;strong&gt;학사 학위 이상&lt;/strong&gt; 소지하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;년 이상&lt;/strong&gt;의 상용 환경 내 머신러닝, 자연어 처리(NLP) 또는 AI 모델 개발, 학습 및 배포 실무 경력을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;워크플로우를 위한 데이터 사이언스 및 알고리즘에 대한 높은 이해와 실무 경험&lt;/strong&gt; (LLM 오케스트레이션 프레임워크 활용, 프롬프트 최적화, 맥락 메모리 관리, Structured Output/Tool-calling 활용 경험)을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python 및 주요 딥러닝 프레임워크(PyTorch, Transformers, vLLM/TRT-LLM 등)에 대한 숙련된 개발 능력을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;데이터 수집, 가공, 합성 데이터(Synthetic Data) 생성 및 정량적 ML/LLM 평가 지표 체계 구축 경험을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL 및 데이터 파이프라인 도구(Spark, Airflow 등)를 활용한 대규모 비정형/반정형 데이터 처리 능력을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;백엔드 엔지니어, 데이터 엔지니어, 프로덕트 매니저 등 다양한 직군과 원활히 소통하고 협업할 수 있는 커뮤니케이션 능력을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우대&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;컴퓨터 과학, 머신러닝, 인공지능 또는 관련 분야의 &lt;strong&gt;석사 또는 박사 학위&lt;/strong&gt; 소지하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;이커머스, 검색, 카탈로그, 지식 그래프(Knowledge Graph) 또는 운영 자동화 도메인에서의 AI/ML 솔루션 구축 경험을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;최신 LLM Post-training 기법(SFT, DPO/PPO, LoRA/QLoRA, Agentic RL 등)에 대한 실무 적용 경험을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;백엔드 엔지니어와의 성공적인 공동 프로젝트 경험 (API 인터페이스 설계, Agent Tool Schema 정의 등)을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/ML 분야 글로벌 탑티어 학회(ICML, NeurIPS, ACL, EMNLP, KDD, AAAI 등) 논문 게재 또는 관련 기술 특허 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;대규모 데이터 처리 및 글로벌 분산 팀 환경에서의 협업 경험을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형 절차 및&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;안내&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;절차&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;서류전형 - 직무 적합성 인터뷰 - 핵심 역량 인터뷰 – 최종 합격&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형절차는 직무별로 다르게 운영될 수 있으며, 일정 및 상황에 따라 변동될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형 일정 및 결과는 지원서에 등록하신 이메일로 개별 안내 드립니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;참고&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 공고는 모집 완료 시 조기 마감될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;지원서 내용 중 허위사실이 있는 경우에는 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;취업 보호 대상자(보훈대상자, 장애인 등)는 관련 법률에 따라 채용우대를 받을 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;직급과 담당 업무 범위는 후보자의 전반적인 경력과 경험 등 제반사정을 고려하여 변경될 수 있습니다. 이러한 변경이 필요할 경우, 최종 합격 통지 전 적절한 시기에 후보자와 커뮤니케이션 될 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;채용 및 업무 수행과 관련하여 요구되는 법령상 자격이 갖추어지지 않은 경우 채용이 제한될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;KO-KR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightHovered SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot;&gt;고용형태는&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;KO-KR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightHovered SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot;&gt;정규직으로&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;KO-KR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightHovered SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot;&gt;수습기간&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightHovered SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot;&gt; 12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;KO-KR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightHovered SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot;&gt;주를&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;KO-KR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightHovered SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot;&gt;포함&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightHovered SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot;&gt;합니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightHovered SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot;&gt;. 단, 업무상 필요한 경우에는 상기 수습기간을 적용하지 않거나 단축 또는 연장할 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightPipeHovered SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW233558440 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;개인정보 처리방침&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;쿠팡 그룹은 입사지원자 개인정보 처리방침(아래 링크)에 따라 귀하의 개인정보를 수집하여 처리합니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;서류&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;반환 정책&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 고지는 『채용절차의공정화에관한법률』 제11조제6항에 따른 것 입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사 채용에 응시한 구직자 중 최종 합격이 되지 못한 구직자는 『채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률』에 따라 제출한 채용서류의 반환을 청구할 수 있음을 알려 드립니다. 다만, 홈페이지 또는 전자우편으로 제출된 경우나 구직자가 당사의 요구 없이 자발적으로 제출한 경우에는 그러하지 아니하며, 천재지변이나 그 밖에 당사에게 책임 없는 사유로 채용서류가 멸실된 경우에는 반환한 것으로 봅니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;위2항 본문에 따라 채용 서류 반환 청구를 하는 구직자는 채용 서류 반환 청구서 [채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률 시행규칙 별지 제 3 호 서식]를 작성하여 이메일 (&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitingops@coupang.com&quot;&gt;recruitingops@coupang.com&lt;/a&gt;) 로 제출하면, 제출이 확인된 날로부터 14 일 이내에 지정한 주소지로 등기우편을 통하여 발송해 드립니다. 이 경우 등기우편요금은 수신자 부담으로 하게 되오니 유념하시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사는 위2항 본문에 따른 구직자의 반환 청구에 대비하여 채용 여부가 확정된 날로부터 180 일간 구직자가 제출한 채용서류 원본을 보관하게 되며, 그때까지 채용서류의 반환을 청구하지 아니할 경우에는 『개인정보 보호법』에 따라 지체 없이 채용서류 일체를 파기할 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;단, 위 1항 내지 4항의 내용은 대한민국의 노동 관계 법령이 적용되는 경우에만 적용됩니다. 그 이외의 경우에는 적용되지 않습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company&amp;nbsp;Introduction&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing e-commerce companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&amp;nbsp;Overview&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Senior Software Development Manager to lead a team of 8–10 engineers working on next-generation platform capabilities within Coupang’s transportation ecosystem. This role will focus on re-architecting systems for global use cases, enabling scalable and standardized solutions across regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead one of the key initiatives in rebuilding foundational platform services, driving both technical direction and team development. The platform operates at massive scale, supporting tens of millions of transactions daily and impacting every shipment processed within Coupang’s ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;opportunity&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;critical&amp;nbsp;initiative&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;re-architecting&amp;nbsp;transportation&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;grow&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;India,&amp;nbsp;owning&amp;nbsp;end-to-end&amp;nbsp;delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;high-scale,&amp;nbsp;event-driven&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;processing&amp;nbsp;30–40&amp;nbsp;million&amp;nbsp;transactions&amp;nbsp;daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;distributed&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;challenges&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;every&amp;nbsp;shipment&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You&amp;nbsp;Will&amp;nbsp;Do&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead,&amp;nbsp;hire,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;grow&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;8–10&amp;nbsp;engineers,&amp;nbsp;setting&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;high&amp;nbsp;bar&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;performance&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;career&amp;nbsp;development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;execution&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;platform&amp;nbsp;initiative&amp;nbsp;focused&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;re-architecting&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;use&amp;nbsp;cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break&amp;nbsp;down&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;problem&amp;nbsp;statements&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;clear&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;designs&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;execution&amp;nbsp;plans,&amp;nbsp;partnering&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;senior&amp;nbsp;engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own&amp;nbsp;end-to-end&amp;nbsp;delivery,&amp;nbsp;ensuring&amp;nbsp;projects&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;executed&amp;nbsp;efficiently&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;planning,&amp;nbsp;tracking,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;program&amp;nbsp;management&amp;nbsp;practices&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;risk&amp;nbsp;identification,&amp;nbsp;mitigation,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;stakeholder&amp;nbsp;communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate&amp;nbsp;cross-functionally&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;align&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;priorities&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;drive&amp;nbsp;large-scale&amp;nbsp;initiatives&amp;nbsp;forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;evolve&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;event-driven,&amp;nbsp;highly&amp;nbsp;scalable&amp;nbsp;system&amp;nbsp;processing&amp;nbsp;tens&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;millions&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;daily&amp;nbsp;transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;high-performance&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;culture&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;focus&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;accountability,&amp;nbsp;ownership,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;continuous&amp;nbsp;improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;software&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;3+&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;background&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Java&amp;nbsp;backend&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;distributed&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;managing&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;10+&amp;nbsp;engineers&amp;nbsp;through&amp;nbsp;full&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;relational&amp;nbsp;databases&amp;nbsp;(MySQL,&amp;nbsp;Aurora,&amp;nbsp;TiDB)&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;NoSQL&amp;nbsp;(DynamoDB)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;event-driven&amp;nbsp;architectures&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;streaming&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;(Kafka,&amp;nbsp;Flink,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;Spark)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track&amp;nbsp;record&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;delivering&amp;nbsp;large-scale,&amp;nbsp;high-reliability&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;communication&amp;nbsp;skills&amp;nbsp;—&amp;nbsp;ability&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;translate&amp;nbsp;between&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;stakeholders&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Computer&amp;nbsp;Science&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;equivalent&amp;nbsp;practical&amp;nbsp;experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;large-scale&amp;nbsp;distributed&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;event-driven&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;e-commerce,&amp;nbsp;transportation,&amp;nbsp;logistics,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;platform&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;re-architecting&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;track&amp;nbsp;record&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;driving&amp;nbsp;cross-team&amp;nbsp;initiatives&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;fast-paced&amp;nbsp;environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;hiring&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;scaling&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;high-growth&amp;nbsp;setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Hybrid work model: Coupang hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration that acts a catalyst to enrich the experience of employees. Employees are required to work at least 3 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 2 days a week, depending on the role requirement. Some businesses may require more time in office due to nature of work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;consider&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Those&amp;nbsp;eligible&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;employment&amp;nbsp;protection&amp;nbsp;(recipients&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;veteran’s&amp;nbsp;benefits,&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;disabled,&amp;nbsp;etc.)&amp;nbsp;may&amp;nbsp;receive&amp;nbsp;preferential&amp;nbsp;treatment&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;employment&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;accordance&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;applicable&amp;nbsp;laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy&amp;nbsp;Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your&amp;nbsp;personal&amp;nbsp;information&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;collected&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;managed&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;Coupang&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;stated&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Application&amp;nbsp;Privacy&amp;nbsp;Notice&amp;nbsp;located&amp;nbsp;below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-left: 0in; width: 7.8847in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-left: 0in; width: 7.8847in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Coupang&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;reimagining&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;shopping&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;goal&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;wowing&amp;nbsp;each&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;instant&amp;nbsp;they&amp;nbsp;open&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Coupang&amp;nbsp;app&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;moment&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;order&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;delivered&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;their&amp;nbsp;door.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Our&amp;nbsp;services&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Taiwan&amp;nbsp;include&amp;nbsp;“Rocket&amp;nbsp;Delivery”&amp;nbsp;which&amp;nbsp;offers&amp;nbsp;next-day&amp;nbsp;delivery&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;wide&amp;nbsp;selection&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;items&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;affordable&amp;nbsp;prices,&amp;nbsp;“Rocket&amp;nbsp;Overseas”&amp;nbsp;which&amp;nbsp;offers&amp;nbsp;free&amp;nbsp;international&amp;nbsp;delivery&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;millions&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;best-selling&amp;nbsp;products&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;Korea,&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;U.S.,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Role Summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly analytical, results-driven Principal, Business Marketing (Search &amp;amp; Google Shopping) to take end-to-end ownership of our paid search engine marketing and shopping channel strategies. In this role, you will manage large budgets across the entire Google ecosystem (Search, Shopping, Performance Max) and Microsoft Advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate embodies Coupang’s Leadership Principles—acting as an owner, diving deep into auction mechanics, systematically optimizing bidding and catalog feed structures, and driving real incremental growth. You will be responsible for scaling net-new GMV, optimizing incremental Return on Ad Spend (iROAS), and working cross-functionally with Analytics, Engineering, Finance, and Category teams to maximize bottom-line profitability. An experimental mindset is essential to learn, innovate, and drive continuous growth. We believe that world-class performance marketing relies on a rigorous &quot;test-and-learn&quot; philosophy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;zh-TW&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Position : &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;zh-TW&quot;&gt;Principal, Business Marketing (Search advertising)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;do?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;1. High-Precision Campaign Execution &amp;amp; Capital Allocation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;End-to-End Channel Ownership: Strategize, launch, scale, and optimize high-budget Google Search (RSA, DSA), Google Shopping (GSA), Performance Max (PMax), and Microsoft Advertising campaigns with a holistic view of company profitability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bidding Calibration &amp;amp; Optimization: Build scalable processes and feedback mechanisms across all Google bidding mechanics. Apply calibration multipliers to align in-platform bids with true incremental returns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Laser-Focused Capital Allocation: Dynamically reallocate daily budget pools between Brand, Non-Brand Search, and Shopping feeds based on margin profiles, unit economics, and peak demand spikes. Eliminate wasteful broad-match spend.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Zero-Defect Standards : Maintain 100% account hygiene, including tracking parameters (MMP / Google Tag / Conversion Signals), bid caps, feed updates, and negative keyword maintenance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;2. Strategic Search Expansion &amp;amp; Catalog Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Aggressive Market Expansion: Lead bold keyword acquisition initiatives to capture dominant market share across Taiwan without compromising efficiency floors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Theme Clustering &amp;amp; Semantic Cohesion: Leverage Dynamic Search Ads (DSA) to capture long-tail intent. Implement intent-based clustering to solve &quot;Theme Fragmentation,&quot; ensuring ad groups remain semantically concise and aligned with Google&#39;s relevance algorithms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Google Merchant Center (GMC) Leadership: Oversee product feed health, title/attribute optimization, automated custom label structures and rapid disapproval resolutions. Own the Google Merchant Excellence report and benchmarks for channel dominance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3. Advanced Analytics, &quot;Deep Dives&quot; &amp;amp; Incrementality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Root Cause Analysis: Conduct granular daily and weekly deep dives into search term reports, auction insights, impression share metrics, and signal drift to prune broad-match leakage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Beyond Surface Metrics: Analyze GMV per Click (GPC), auction impression share, conversion delay models, and SKU-level performance rather than relying on surface clicks or platform-reported figures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Incrementality &amp;amp; Lift Measurement: Lead user-level Conversion Lift experiments (Ghost Ads / Holdouts) to establish true incremental ROAS (iROAS) and calibrate Smart Bidding algorithms despite channel complexities and dependencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Pipeline Validation: Partner with data engineering to validate web and mobile app attribution pipelines across Google Tag, Firebase SDK, and MMPs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4. Cross-Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Executive Alignment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Data-Led Stakeholder Alignment: Translate complex auction mechanics, calibration models, and incrementality data into actionable insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Constructive Alignment :&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt; Challenge assumptions openly using data when evaluating campaign launches. Once a direction is set, execute with full commitment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Basic&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8 to 10+ years of hands-on experience managing large-scale performance marketing budgets specifically within Google Ads (Search, Shopping, PMax) and SEM, ideally within E-Commerce or high-growth tech environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Budget Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of managing large daily/monthly budgets (tens of thousands USD daily spend) in fast-paced e-commerce or marketplace environments with a strong sense of urgency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Bidding Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level technical understanding of Google&#39;s Smart Bidding algorithms, auction-time signals, conversion delay models, and feed optimization tactics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Literacy &amp;amp; Deep Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of Excel/Google Sheets (advanced modeling). Experience with SQL, Python, or BI tools (Looker/Tableau/BigQuery) for executing technical audits and processing raw conversion logs is desired.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MMP &amp;amp; Tracking Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong technical understanding of Mobile Measurement Partner (MMP) integrations, Firebase SDK, URL tracking parameters, and web-to-app conversion pathways.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First-Principles Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; A first-principles thinker who creates SOPs rather than just following them. Hungry for new knowledge and proactive in adopting privacy-first platform technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Preferred&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;Extreme Ownership:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt; You close every thread you start. You are responsible for the health of the account 24/7 and ensure seamless transitions and delegations during absences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;The &quot;Hungry&quot; Learner:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt; You don&#39;t settle for &quot;I don&#39;t know.&quot; You are motivated to explore the &quot;why&quot; behind performance shifts and stay ahead of platform algorithm changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt;Efficiency First:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri;&quot;&gt; You understand that scaling is easy, but scaling profitably is an art. You focus on purifying signals rather than just buying impressions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Recruitment&amp;nbsp;Process&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Others&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Recruitment&amp;nbsp;Process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Application Review - Job Fit Interview - Focus Interview – Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;exact&amp;nbsp;nature&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;recruitment&amp;nbsp;process&amp;nbsp;may&amp;nbsp;vary&amp;nbsp;according&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;specific&amp;nbsp;job&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;may&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;changed&amp;nbsp;due&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;scheduling&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;circumstances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
