&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The CS Quality Assurance &amp;amp; Performance Management team is responsible for establishing and driving quality standards across Customer Service operations. The team develops scalable quality frameworks, performance measurement methodologies, and operational governance processes that enable consistent customer experiences while supporting business growth. As a Senior Manager of CS QA &amp;amp; Performance Management, you will act as a hands-on strategic leader, deeply integrating quality governance with operational planning to optimize workforce efficiency and champion Coupang&#39;s Customer Obsession culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
