&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Establish comprehensive evaluation methodologies and auditing mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Monitor quality performance continuously and drive customer experience improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Lead root cause analysis (RCA) and corrective action initiatives to address operational gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Deep-dive into front-line workflows to lead workforce planning, capacity forecasting, and resource allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Develop performance management frameworks and data-driven reporting systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Monitor operational metrics and optimize overall efficiency across service channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Assess business impact and execute effective resource deployment strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Product, Program, Operations, and Training teams to drive organizational alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
