&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are looking for a seasoned leader to partner closely with our Business Development team to build programs and methodologies focused on Buyability and Selection Quality. This individual will be responsible for working cross-functionally across various stakeholders including; product teams, engineering teams, catalog teams, and various business leaders. This role requires an individual with excellent attention to detail, a knack for operational process planning, analytical capabilities, and strong business acumen. Additionally, this candidate will be a self-starter, comfortable operating in ambiguous environments, and will own working with multiple operational processes across a wide range of stakeholder teams. The candidate will have a successful track record of collaborative relationship building, program and project management, experiencing leading projects, and reporting and analysis capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
