&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Define the vision for category growth through best-in-class inputs across availability, price sharpness and delivery experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
