&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Team Overview &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Trust and Safety team at Coupang is responsible for curbing fraud and abuse and thereby improving customer and sellers trust on the platform, while ensuring that genuine customers/ sellers get the best of experiences. Trust and Safety team develops policies and standards, provides appropriate guidance, and helps to implement and monitor controls to identify and mitigate risks across the platform. The team partners with business and operations to design products, services and controls which reduce fraud and risk vulnerabilities, and govern the process by measuring, monitoring, and reporting fraud risks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are seeking a dynamic and experienced Trust &amp;amp; Safety Compliance Auditor to join our team. In this role, you will play a critical role in ensuring that our products meet all Trust and safety compliance standards. You will develop audit programs, and collaborate closely with cross-functional teams to drive continuous improvement in Trust &amp;amp; Safety compliance practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;seeking&amp;nbsp;a dynamic and experienced Manager of&amp;nbsp;Trust&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Safety Compliance Audit to join our team. In this role, you will play a critical role in ensuring that our products meet all&amp;nbsp;Trust and&amp;nbsp;safety compliance standards. You will lead a team of auditors, develop audit programs, and collaborate closely with cross-functional teams to drive continuous improvement in&amp;nbsp;Trust&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Safety compliance practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Programs and Execution:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and execute comprehensive audit programs to assess&amp;nbsp;trust and&amp;nbsp;safety compliance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct on-site and remote compliance audits for&amp;nbsp;trust&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;safety compliance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review and analyze audit findings,&amp;nbsp;identifying&amp;nbsp;non-compliance&amp;nbsp;issues&amp;nbsp;and opportunities for improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay up-to date with relevant policies,&amp;nbsp;procedures&amp;nbsp;and SOPs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and mentor a team of&amp;nbsp;trust and&amp;nbsp;safety compliance auditors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide guidance, training, and support to audit team members to ensure effective audit execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Foster a culture of continuous improvement and commitment to&amp;nbsp;trust and&amp;nbsp;safety.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams, including&amp;nbsp;fraud operation teams,&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;teams, quality assurance, supply chain&amp;nbsp;and legal to address compliance issues and drive corrective actions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicate audit findings and recommendations to stakeholders at all levels of the organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting and Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare detailed audit reports, including findings, observations, and recommendations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain&amp;nbsp;accurate&amp;nbsp;and organized audit records and documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives to enhance&amp;nbsp;trust and&amp;nbsp;safety compliance processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor the effectiveness of corrective actions and preventive measures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in relevant field; advanced degree or relevant certifications preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10 years of experience in&amp;nbsp;trust and&amp;nbsp;safety compliance auditing, with 5 years in a leadership or managerial role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong knowledge of relevant industry regulations and standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to lead and motivate a team, fostering a collaborative and results-oriented work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attention to detail and&amp;nbsp;a commitment&amp;nbsp;to delivering high-quality audit outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
