&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is seeking a Product Manager to join the International Transportation Product team, responsible for building and scaling technology products that power our end-to-end transportation network across Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role owns products spanning the entire transportation journey, from supplier pickup and fulfillment center movement to last-mile delivery and returns. You will work closely with operations, engineering, and data teams to develop innovative products that improve efficiency, reliability, and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a Taiwan-only role. The successful candidate will have opportunities to drive transportation technology initiatives with global impact, including our strategic address intelligence platform and next-generation delivery applications across multiple markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage products across the full transportation lifecycle:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First Mile (Supplier → Fulfillment Center)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Middle Mile (Fulfillment Center → Delivery Station)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Last Mile (Delivery Station → Customer / Returns)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define product strategy, roadmap, and requirements based on business needs and operational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write detailed product requirements and work closely with engineering teams throughout the development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with operations teams to identify opportunities for automation, efficiency improvement, and service enhancement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transportation Technology Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of transportation technology products that improve network efficiency and delivery performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of new products through User Acceptance Testing (UAT), pilot programs, and large-scale rollout across the network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop AI-powered solutions to enhance delivery quality, compliance, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Address Intelligence Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of Coupang&#39;s proprietary address intelligence platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build products that leverage delivery insights collected across millions of customer interactions and thousands of drivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help create scalable infrastructure that improves address accuracy, route efficiency, and delivery success rates across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery App Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive enhancements to the delivery applications used by drivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on innovative capabilities including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real-time delivery photo verification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location compliance validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Image intelligence and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-powered operational tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering, Operations, Data Analytics, and Business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make data-driven product decisions through metrics analysis and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence transportation technology strategy across Taiwan and other international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of Product Management or Product Ownership experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing products from concept through launch and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience writing product requirements and working closely with engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English &amp;amp; Chinese communication skills (written and verbal).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently based in Taiwan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Transportation, Logistics, Mobility, Ride-Hailing, Delivery, or Supply Chain industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software Engineering background, especially candidates who transitioned from SDE to Product Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building data-intensive or platform products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with AI, machine learning, or operational technology products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple countries or global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build transportation products with global impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own mission-critical systems supporting one of the fastest-growing eCommerce networks in Asia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on cutting-edge AI applications in logistics and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product strategy across multiple markets, including Taiwan, Korea, and future expansion markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with highly collaborative teams spanning Product, Engineering, Data, and Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Overseas” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly experienced and results-oriented Senior Program Management Specialist of Cross-Border Business to bring the best experiences to our customers and drive growth in cross-border sales. In this role, you will be responsible for developing and executing strategies to optimize operations and maximize revenue opportunities with your strong cross-functional communication and analytical skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement comprehensive cross-border business strategies to expand the company’s presence in Taiwan market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams, including marketing, overseas vendors, product, and operations to ensure alignment and execution of cross-border initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cross-functional projects to dive into pain points, improve operational efficiency, streamline processes, and enhance the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze sales performance, market trends, and customer feedback to identify opportunity of new selections and marketing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in program management or business operations, preferably in the e-commerce or retail industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about global market trends, cross-border merchandise selection, and consumer insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to deep dive into complex issues, demonstrate attention to detail, and solve customer service issues efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of designing and implementing performance metrics and driving business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and strong capability in Excel with the ability to interpret data and identify trends for making data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, with the ability to influence and collaborate effectively across departments and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated project management experience, including the ability to prioritize tasks, manage timelines, and deliver results in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in written and spoken Mandarin and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience using SQL is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
