&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with other engineering teams to make the platform open and extensible to unlock innumerable opportunities for innovations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Align with stakeholders and lead engineers on mission critical projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
