&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep-dive and handle critical system issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with other teams to make the platform open and extensible to unlock&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;innumerable opportunities for innovations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
