&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Strong experience on Cloud DevOps tools and coding (CI/CD, IaC, Terraform, Python, Cloud Formation, Ansible, GitHub, CircleCI, Jenkins and Infra Automation)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
