&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Serve as Cloud Engineering for Cloud infrastructure Architecture, Design and Deployment and maintenance for highly reliable and scalable applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Solves complex technical problems in Public Clouds (AWS, Azure, GCP) and Private Cloud environment and improves Operational Excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
