&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Analyze complex distributed production deployments and recommend ways to optimize performance and/or automate processes by managing continuous integration servers, utilizing monitoring and testing tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
