&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Application Review - Phone Interview - Onsite (or Virtual Onsite) Interview – Offer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The exact nature of the recruitment process may vary according to the specific job and may be changed due to scheduling or other circumstances.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Interview schedules and the results will be informed to the applicant via the e-mail address submitted at the application stage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Details to Consider&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This job posting may be closed prior to the stated end date for application if all openings are filled.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Coupang has the right to rescind an offer of employment if a candidate is found to have submitted false information as part of the application process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Those eligible for employment protection (recipients of veteran’s benefits, the disabled, etc.) may receive preferential treatment for employment in accordance with applicable laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Job titles and responsibilities may be subject to change depending on the candidate’s overall experience, etc. This will be communicated to the candidate at the appropriate time before the offer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Hiring may be restricted in case the legal qualifications required for hiring and work performance is not met.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is a full-time regular position and includes 12 weeks of probation period; provided, however, the probationary period may be either skipped, shortened or extended if necessary for business purposes.&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/en/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/en/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Process Innovation team drives process improvement across the entire supply chain by analyzing Coupang&#39;s processes and supports the implementation/settlement of the items on the field, thereby contributing to enhancing Coupang&#39;s competitiveness. Improving process &amp;amp; cost are the primary goals for this role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;These roles require scoping and creating project plans, developing processes, coordinating and driving execution, and communicating to senior management on status, risks and process/product changes. Cross-team coordination, project management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive strategic process innovation initiatives across the fulfillment center network, identifying opportunities to improve safety, quality, productivity, cost, and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead network-level programs and process transformation initiatives, ensuring scalable and standardized solutions across multiple fulfillment centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, implement, and continuously improve operational processes, standard work, and governance mechanisms to support business growth and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize data analytics, performance metrics, and structured problem-solving methodologies to identify process gaps, uncover root causes, and develop sustainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects and programs involving Operations, Technology, Planning, Analytics, Finance, Engineering, and other business stakeholders to deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the design, testing, and deployment of innovative process improvements, automation opportunities, and productivity-enhancing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep dives on recurring operational challenges, service disruptions, and performance variances, ensuring systematic root cause elimination and long-term corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop business cases, influence senior stakeholders, and secure alignment on process improvement initiatives and investment opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish mechanisms to monitor key operational metrics, measure program success, and track realization of expected benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide process innovation team members while fostering a culture of continuous improvement, experimentation, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional and global stakeholders to benchmark best practices and implement scalable solutions across the network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a thought leader in process innovation by leveraging Lean, Six Sigma, automation, and emerging technologies to optimize fulfillment operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Supply Chain, Logistics, Operations, Industrial Engineering, Industrial Design, Computer Science, Business Analytics, or related STEM field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience working cross-functionally with both technical and non-technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of program management, project management, process improvement, or operational excellence experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience delivering large-scale cross-functional projects or programs with measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining program requirements, establishing success metrics, and using data-driven methodologies to identify and implement improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience conducting complex data analysis, root cause investigations, and translating insights into scalable operational solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management, communication, and influencing skills, including experience presenting to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced, highly ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience driving continuous improvement, process optimization, Lean, Six Sigma, or operational excellence initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree or MBA in Business, Operations Management, Supply Chain, Industrial Engineering, Data Analytics, Instructional Design, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading large-scale operational transformation, automation, or technology implementation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within fulfillment, logistics, supply chain, manufacturing, e-commerce, or equivalent operational environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical capabilities with experience using data visualization, reporting, and decision-support tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence without authority and successfully lead diverse stakeholder groups across multiple functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring and developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in Mandarin and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Recruitment Process and Others &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Recruitment Process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;29&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Application Review - Job Fit Interview - Focus Interview – Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
