&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;31&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;회사 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡은 고객 감동 실현을 위해 존재합니다. 고객들이 &quot;쿠팡 없이 그동안 어떻게 살았을까?&quot; 라고 말할 때, 비로소 우리의 미션을 실현하고 있음을 알 수 있습니다. 고객들의 쇼핑과 식사, 생활 전반을 편하게 만들겠다는 유일한 집념으로 쿠팡은 수억 달러 규모의 이커머스 산업 전반의 혁신을 이끌고 있습니다. 쿠팡은 가장 빠르게 성장하는 이커머스 기업 중 하나로, 국내 커머스 업계에서의 독보적인 입지와, 고객 신뢰를 구축했습니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡은 스타트업 문화를 기반으로 한 글로벌 대형 상장사라고 자부합니다. 이것이 창립 당시의 기민함을 지하며, 신규 서비스를 끊임없이 출시하며 비즈니스를 확장해 나가는 우리의 성장 동력입니다. 쿠팡의 모든 임직원에게는 기업가 정신을 갖추고 새로운 혁신과 이니셔티브를 추진할 수 있는 기회가 주어집니다. 주저 없이 일에 뛰어들어 성과를 이루고자 하는 과감성이, 바로 쿠팡이 일하는 방식의 본질입니다. 쿠팡에서는 여러분 자신, 동료, 팀 그리고 회사 전체가 매일 성장하는 모습을 목격할 것입니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡의 모든 직원은 커머스의 미래를 만들겠다는 쿠팡의 미션에 진심입니다. 우리는 고객의 문제를 해결해 나가고, 전통적인 관념과 통념에 맞서며 실현 가능한 한계를 뛰어넘고 있습니다. 고가용성 (always-on) 과 최첨단의 앞선 기술 (high-tech), 초연결사회 (hyper-connected world) 에서의 놀라운 업무 경험을 원하신다면, 지금 바로 쿠팡에 합류하세요.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;직무 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;카탈로그 오퍼레이션 조직은 서울, 연길, 대만의 400명 이상 규모 인력을 기반으로 감사 프레임워크(Audit Framework) 설계, 카탈로그 품질 프로그램, 인력 스케일링, 거버넌스 관리 등 최우선 순위(P0) 프로젝트들을 운영합니다. 조직이 성장함에 따라 이 핵심 포지션들을 전담하여 이끌어갈 책임자(Single-threaded owner)가 필요합니다. 본 역할은 최우선 프로그램들이 차질 없이 추적·관리되고, 높은 품질 기준을 충족하며 완수되도록 총괄합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Senior Operations Program Manager는 P0 이니셔티브 포트폴리오 전체를 엔드투엔드(End-to-End)로 관리합니다. 조직 전체의 방향성을 맞추는 운영 체계를 설계·운영하고, 특정 팀에 속하지 않는 영역의 실행을 이끌며, 리더십의 의사결정이 명확한 실행 과제로 이어지도록 만듭니다. 서울, 연길, 대만의 오피스 리더십과 긴밀히 협력하며 조직의 이니셔티브 전달을 책임지는 고임팩트·실행 중심의 리더 역할입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;업무 내용&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;P0 포트폴리오 관리 (P0 Portfolio Management)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;모든 P0 이니셔티브의통합 현황을 관리하고 프로젝트 계획, 의존성, 리스크, 이스컬레이션 경로를 운영합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;일정이 지연되는 지점을 조기에 파악하여 리더십에 갑작스러운 이슈로 보고되기 전에 선제적으로 해결합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;운영 체계 및 프로세스 구축 (Operating Cadence and Mechanisms)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;주간 비즈니스 리뷰(WBR), 월간 딥다이브(MBR), 분기별 기획(QBR) 등 조직의 전체적인 운영 리듬을 설계하고 이끕니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;회의 아젠다의 질, 사전 읽기 자료(Pre-read)의 표준, 그리고 액션 아이템 관리(Action item register)를 철저히 관리합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;회의에서 결정된 사항은 담당자와 기한이 명확한 실행 과제로 할당하며, 모든 항목에 대해 완료까지 추적합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;크로스 사이트 및 크로스 펑셔널 실행 (Cross-Site and Cross-Functional Execution)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;여러 국가에 걸쳐 있거나 오퍼레이션, 엔지니어링, 품질(QA) 등 다수 부서에 걸쳐 있는 프로젝트를 총괄 관리합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;담당 팀이 모호하고 리더십 공백의 위험이 높은 이니셔티브(예: 감사 프레임워크 도입, 거버넌스 개편, 카탈로그 목표 달성을 위한 거점별 확장 프로그램 등)를 주도합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;임원진 보고 및 서사 작성 (Executive Reporting and Narrative)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;비즈니스 리뷰 문서, 리더십 업데이트, 기획 보고서 등 상부 보고용 문서를 작성합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;복잡한 오퍼레이션 상세 현황을 VP급 이상 임원진의 의사결정에 도움이 되는 명확하고 간결한 서사(Narrative) 문서로 변환합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;카탈로그 결함 조사 및 해결 (Catalog Defect Investigation and Resolution)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;카탈로그 결함의 근본 원인 분석(RCA)을 전담하는 소규모 조사 팀을 이끕니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;명확한 마일스톤과 담당자가 포함된 문제 해결 문서(Correction of Error, CoE)를 작성합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;타 부서 담당자들과 협력하여 결함 해결 방안이 실제 적용될 때까지의 전 과정을 총괄 관리합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;팀 리더로서 조사 프로세스의 품질 기준을 설정하고, 팀의 분석 역량을 강화하며, 조직의 요구 수준에 맞춰 결함 처리 속도를 유지합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전략적 이니셔티브 수행 (Strategic Initiatives)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;특정 팀의 관할에 속하지 않지만 시급하고 중요한 문제들을 발굴하고 해결합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;모호한 문제의 범위를 정의하고, 이해관계자들의 의견을 조율하며, 최종 결과물을 이끌어냅니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;자격&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;요건&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;오퍼레이션, 프로그램 매니지먼트 또는 경영 컨설팅 경력 8년 이상 (대규모 오퍼레이션 환경에서 다중 워크스트림 프로그램을 관리해 본 경력 3년 이상 포함)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;직접 관리하지 않는 부서 및 조직에 대해 영향력(Influence)을 발휘하여 성과를 만들어낸 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;뛰어난 서면 소통 능력: 여러 부서의 복잡한 진행 상황을 임원진이 바로 의사결정할 수 있는 간결한 문서로 요약할 수 있는 역량&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;운영 프로세스(비즈니스 리뷰, 기획 주기, 이스컬레이션 프로세스 등)를 직접 설계하고 운영해 본 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;오퍼레이션 데이터에 대한 이해도: 각 팀이 보고하는 데이터를 검증할 수 있을 정도의 샘플링 개념, 품질 지표, 캐파(Capacity) 모델 활용 능력&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;소규모 오퍼레이션 또는 프로그램 팀을 리드하거나 멘토링해 본 경험 (실무자 역할과 피플 매니저 역할을 모두 원활히 수행할 수 있는 분)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우대&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;이커머스, 마켓플레이스 오퍼레이션, 카탈로그, 콘텐츠, Trust &amp;amp; Safety 등 품질 중심 오퍼레이션 영역에서의 근무 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;여러 거점에 분산된 다국적 조직에서 C-Level/임원급 리더를 지원해 본 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;비즈니스급 영어 회화 및 작성 능력과 함께 한국어 또는 중국어 활용이 가능하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;대규모 조직 환경에서 Jira 기반으로 프로그램 및 프로젝트를 추적해 본 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형 절차 및&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;안내&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;절차&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;서류전형 - 직무 적합성 인터뷰 - 핵심 역량 인터뷰 – 최종 합격&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형절차는 직무별로 다르게 운영될 수 있으며, 일정 및 상황에 따라 변동될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형 일정 및 결과는 지원서에 등록하신 이메일로 개별 안내 드립니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;참고&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 공고는 모집 완료 시 조기 마감될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;지원서 내용 중 허위사실이 있는 경우에는 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;취업 보호 대상자(보훈대상자, 장애인 등)는 관련 법률에 따라 채용우대를 받을 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;직급과 담당 업무 범위는 후보자의 전반적인 경력과 경험 등 제반사정을 고려하여 변경될 수 있습니다. 이러한 변경이 필요할 경우, 최종 합격 통지 전 적절한 시기에 후보자와 커뮤니케이션 될 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;채용 및 업무 수행과 관련하여 요구되는 법령상 자격이 갖추어지지 않은 경우 채용이 제한될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;고용형태는 정규직으로 수습기간 12주를 포함합니다. 단, 업무상 필요한 경우에는 상기 수습기간을 적용하지 않거나 단축 또는 연장할 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;개인정보 처리방침&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;쿠팡 그룹은 입사지원자 개인정보 처리방침(아래 링크)에 따라 귀하의 개인정보를 수집하여 처리합니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;서류&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;반환 정책&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 고지는 『채용절차의공정화에관한법률』 제11조제6항에 따른 것 입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사 채용에 응시한 구직자 중 최종 합격이 되지 못한 구직자는 『채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률』에 따라 제출한 채용서류의 반환을 청구할 수 있음을 알려 드립니다. 다만, 홈페이지 또는 전자우편으로 제출된 경우나 구직자가 당사의 요구 없이 자발적으로 제출한 경우에는 그러하지 아니하며, 천재지변이나 그 밖에 당사에게 책임 없는 사유로 채용서류가 멸실된 경우에는 반환한 것으로 봅니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;위2항 본문에 따라 채용 서류 반환 청구를 하는 구직자는 채용 서류 반환 청구서 [채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률 시행규칙 별지 제 3 호 서식]를 작성하여 이메일 (&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitingops@coupang.com&quot;&gt;recruitingops@coupang.com&lt;/a&gt;) 로 제출하면, 제출이 확인된 날로부터 14 일 이내에 지정한 주소지로 등기우편을 통하여 발송해 드립니다. 이 경우 등기우편요금은 수신자 부담으로 하게 되오니 유념하시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사는 위2항 본문에 따른 구직자의 반환 청구에 대비하여 채용 여부가 확정된 날로부터 180 일간 구직자가 제출한 채용서류 원본을 보관하게 되며, 그때까지 채용서류의 반환을 청구하지 아니할 경우에는 『개인정보 보호법』에 따라 지체 없이 채용서류 일체를 파기할 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;단, 위 1항 내지 4항의 내용은 대한민국의 노동 관계 법령이 적용되는 경우에만 적용됩니다. 그 이외의 경우에는 적용되지 않습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;職位說明&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我們正在尋找一位具備高度分析能力、策略思維以及強大執行力的定價運營管理資深經理（Senior&amp;nbsp;Manager&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;Pricing&amp;nbsp;Operation&amp;nbsp;Management），來領導我們表現卓越的定價卓越團隊。在此職位中，您將負責兩個關鍵子功能：競品研究與新增以及定價內部流程優化。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;您將負責推動市場價格競爭力（price&amp;nbsp;sharpness）、設計可擴展的運營框架，並主導跨產品與工程團隊的端到端專案，以消除業務浪費並最大化利潤回收。理想的候選人應具備卓越的領導原則、系統性思考能力，並在高壓時程及高風險環境中具備交付高影響成果的成功經驗。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;主要職責&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;部門管理與策略&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;團隊發展：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;領導、招募並管理持續成長的運營團隊；指導團隊成員從強執行力，進階為能獨立負責模組、進行長期規劃及具備系統性思維的專業人才。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;跨部門協作：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;作為營運、產品及工程團隊之間的核心對接窗口，優化需求規劃流程，並大幅降低臨時性升級處理及線上事故的發生。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;競品研究與新增（市場競爭力與情報）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;市場監控：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;主導持續監控主要競爭對手的策略，於大型促銷旺季打破監控限制，並針對新目標渠道執行市場研究。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;價格競爭力優化：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;推動複雜折扣模型及定價功能的落地，以確保內部指標的一致性與競爭力。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;可擴展匹配框架：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;管理大型商品／帳戶預熱及自動化匹配架構（在短時間內處理&amp;nbsp;800+&amp;nbsp;帳戶與&amp;nbsp;7&amp;nbsp;萬+&amp;nbsp;匹配卡片），以提升商品匹配度與召回率。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;任職條件與資格&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;工作經驗：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;具備&amp;nbsp;6&amp;nbsp;年以上定價運營、電商運營或產品／專案管理經驗，其中至少&amp;nbsp;2&amp;nbsp;年以上團隊管理或領導經驗。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;專案管理能力：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;具備從端到端管理產品路線圖的能力，能在快速變動的環境中做出技術與設計取捨，並有效縮短開發週期。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;危機應對與韌性：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;能在高風險且時間敏感的專案（如雙&amp;nbsp;11／大型促銷活動）中展現高度抗壓能力，並能於週末執行線上風險控管，達成零客戶影響。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;•&amp;nbsp;分析能力與系統思維：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;能將零散且不一致的營運訊號整合為結構化問題框架，並建立全面性的端到端浪費降低機制。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Company Introduction&lt;br&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we&#39;re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, &quot;How did I ever live without Coupang?&quot; Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we are collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar commerce industry from the ground up and establishing an unparalleled reputation for being leading and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what&#39;s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Role Overview&lt;br&gt;As Legal Counsel, IP (Patents), you will play a central role in protecting and scaling Coupang&#39;s innovation portfolio. You will partner closely with engineering and product teams to identify high-impact inventions, guide patent strategy, and enable the business to move fast while managing risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role with broad exposure across patent lifecycle management, innovation strategy, and patent advisory—including freedom-to-operate, licensing, and disputes. You will operate at the intersection of technology, law, and business, helping translate innovation into competitive advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What You Will Do&lt;br&gt;• Own and evolve patent portfolios across key technology areas supporting Coupang&#39;s products and services&lt;br&gt;• Drive end-to-end patent lifecycle execution, from invention harvesting and drafting to global filings and prosecution&lt;br&gt;• Partner with engineers and product leaders to identify patentable innovations and align IP strategy with business priorities&lt;br&gt;• Advise on patent risk and strategy, including freedom-to-operate (FTO), licensing, invalidity, and dispute-related matters&lt;br&gt;• Enable a culture of innovation by building and enhancing inventor engagement and patent awareness programs&lt;br&gt;• Collaborate cross-functionally with Legal, Compliance, Engineering, Product, and business stakeholders to deliver practical, business-oriented IP solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;br&gt;• Qualified Patent Attorney (US or Korea)&lt;br&gt;• 15+ years of patent law experience (in-house and/or law firm)&lt;br&gt;• Strong expertise in patent prosecution and portfolio management&lt;br&gt;• Fluency in English is a must. Additional language fluency especially Korean is desired but not a must&lt;br&gt;• Ability to translate complex legal concepts into clear, actionable business guidance&lt;br&gt;• Proven ability to work cross-functionally in fast-paced, high-growth environments&lt;br&gt;• Strong judgment, ownership mindset, and problem-solving capability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;br&gt;• Experience working across both law firm and in-house environments&lt;br&gt;• Technical background in computer science, electrical engineering, or related fields&lt;br&gt;• Experience with software, platform, or internet technologies (e.g., UI/UX, video, systems, e-commerce)&lt;br&gt;• Exposure to patent litigation, licensing, FTO, or IP due diligence&lt;br&gt;• Experience operating in global or technology-driven organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruitment Process and Others&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;br&gt;• Application Review - Phone Interview - Onsite (or Virtual Onsite) Interview – Offer&lt;br&gt;• The exact nature of the recruitment process may vary according to the specific job and may be changed due to scheduling or other circumstances.&lt;br&gt;• Interview schedules and the results will be informed to the applicant via the e-mail address submitted at the application stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Details to Consider&lt;br&gt;• This job posting may be closed prior to the stated end date for application if all openings are filled.&lt;br&gt;• Coupang has the right to rescind an offer of employment if a candidate is found to have submitted false information as part of the application process.&lt;br&gt;• Those eligible for employment protection (recipients of veteran&#39;s benefits, the disabled, etc.) may receive preferential treatment for employment in accordance with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;• Job titles and responsibilities may be subject to change depending on the candidate&#39;s overall experience, etc. This will be communicated to the candidate at the appropriate time before the offer.&lt;br&gt;• Hiring may be restricted in case the legal qualifications required for hiring and work performance is not met.&lt;br&gt;• This is a full-time regular position and includes 12 weeks of probation period; provided, however, the probationary period may be either skipped, shortened or extended if necessary for business purposes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;br&gt;• Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below.&lt;br&gt;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Document Return Policy&lt;br&gt;1. This notification is given pursuant to Article 11 (6) of the Fair Hiring Procedure Act.&lt;br&gt;2. A job applicant, who has applied but not been finally selected for a position at Coupang (the &quot;Company&quot;), may request the Company to return his/her hiring documents submitted pursuant to the Fair Hiring Procedure Act. However, this will not apply where the hiring documents were submitted via the website of the Company or e-mail, or where the job applicant submitted those documents voluntarily without a request from the Company. In addition, if the hiring documents were destroyed due to a natural disaster or any other reasons not attributable to the Company, such documents will be deemed to have been returned to the job applicant.&lt;br&gt;3. A job applicant who wishes to request the return of his/her hiring documents pursuant to the main sentence of paragraph 2 above should fill out a &quot;Request for Return of Hiring Documents&quot; [Annex Form No. 3 in the Enforcement Rule of the Fair Hiring Procedure Act] and submit it by email (recruitingops@coupang.com). In such case, within fourteen (14) days from the date of identifying the receipt of the request, the Company will send the hiring documents to the job applicant&#39;s designated address via registered mail. Please be informed that the job applicant is required to pay the postage on the registered mail.&lt;br&gt;4. In preparation for a job applicant&#39;s request for the return of hiring documents pursuant to the main sentence of paragraph 2 above, the Company shall retain the original hiring documents submitted by the job applicant for 180 days from the completion of the recruiting process. If no request is made until the end of this period, all his/her hiring documents will be destroyed immediately in accordance with the Personal Information Protection Act.&lt;br&gt;5. The above paragraphs 1 - 4 shall only apply when the labor-related laws of Korea govern the application. They are otherwise not applicable.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Job Summary&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive data-driven process innovation across fulfillment and warehouse operations by applying analytical thinking, structured problem-solving, and continuous improvement methodologies. Partner with cross-functional teams to identify opportunities, influence decisions, and deliver scalable solutions that improve productivity, quality, and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyze operational data to identify process bottlenecks, inefficiencies, and improvement opportunities across warehouse operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply structured problem-solving and root cause analysis to design and implement sustainable process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with Operations, Product, Engineering, and other stakeholders to align priorities and drive optimization initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop KPIs, dashboards, and reports to support data-driven decision-making and effectively communicate performance insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead cross-functional projects and pilot programs from concept through implementation, ensuring measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Industrial Engineering, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of experience in process improvement, operations excellence, supply chain, logistics, or fulfillment center operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical and logical reasoning skills with the ability to solve complex operational problems using data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of KPI development, root cause analysis, process mapping, and workflow optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to collaborate with cross-functional stakeholders, influence decisions, and drive execution in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience performing large-scale data analysis using SQL, Excel, Python, R, or similar analytical tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with simulation, optimization modeling, or operations research techniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with warehouse management systems (WMS), automation technologies, and operational analytics platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading cross-functional projects from concept through implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate complex data into actionable business insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;WCTF WCSF WETF&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;WFTF wd-5a2fb204-dee8-47c8-9465-a3690c07b137&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our team - &lt;strong&gt;TW CX Audit team&lt;/strong&gt; is a core operational organization responsible for auditing and managing the quality and regulatory compliance of all product pages and advertising content on the e-commerce platform. Through standardized operating procedures (SOPs) and meticulous information review, we are dedicated to eliminating any erroneous information that could impact the shopping experience. In a rapidly growing environment, we leverage data analysis and process innovation to maximize operational efficiency, while working in close collaboration with diverse cross-functional teams to continuously raise listing quality standards, creating a safe, high-quality, and trusted online shopping environment for millions of Taiwanese consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;As the Manager of this team, you will oversee end-to-end product page and ad content moderation operations and lead a large-scale operations team, devising and executing strategies to drive SOP compliance and review accuracy. We are seeking a business leader who can solve operational bottlenecks through data-driven insights and continuously drive process improvements through proactive collaboration with relevant stakeholder teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Manager at Coupang, you will act as a pivotal leader bridging high-level corporate strategy with aggressive, data-driven execution. Known internally for a culture demanding extreme ownership and a &quot;bias for action,&quot; you will lead high-impact initiatives to eliminate trade-offs for our customers and drive exponential business growth. You will be responsible for defining operational or product strategies, designing scalable processes, and leading a high-performing team in a fast-paced, ambiguous environment. To succeed, you must be a hands-on leader who dives deep into data, uncovers root causes, and obsessively works to achieve results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Drive organization-wide strategies, roadmaps, and frameworks that support hyper-growth and long-term organizational agility.&lt;br&gt;• Lead, mentor, and grow a team of managers and individual contributors, fostering an environment modeled on Coupang&#39;s Leadership Principles.&lt;br&gt;• Own critical business KPIs and operational SLA metrics, building robust business cases and running complex data models.&lt;br&gt;• Act as a &quot;working manager&quot;—willing to break down complex problems into clear, actionable steps and get your hands dirty alongside your team.&lt;br&gt;• Partner with global product, operations, legal, and engineering stakeholders to navigate local operational dependencies and align cross-functional visions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_b89f0525d2889aa1&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;• &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Strategic Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute end-to-end strategies and scaling roadmaps for designated business units or product lines to drive continuous growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;• &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;164&quot;&gt;Team &amp;amp; People Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct headcount planning, performance management, and career development to lead direct and indirect reports in achieving organizational goals.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;• &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;337&quot;&gt;Data-Driven Optimization &amp;amp; CX Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage advanced analytics and Root Cause Analysis (RCA) to eliminate systemic defects and continuously optimize customer experience (CX) and operational processes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;• &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;548&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Overcome time zones and departmental silos to influence and align goals with international teams, ensuring high-impact execution of overall company strategy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;• &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;740&quot;&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Lifecycle Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify operational bottlenecks and potential risks while overseeing the full lifecycle of major project rollouts.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;• &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;899&quot;&gt;Change Management &amp;amp; Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and execute comprehensive change management frameworks to minimize operational disruption, foster agility, and sustain high performance amidst dynamic business shifts.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;first-token&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;• 7+ years of professional experience in e-commerce marketplace, manufacturing, data analytics, AI/IT operations, or customer service background.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Fluent in English and Traditional Mandarin (both written and verbal).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Highly analytical, detail-oriented, with strong business acumen and the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, growing environment.&lt;br&gt;• Strong ability to gather, analyze, and organize large datasets to generate actionable insights, define audit scopes/defect criteria, and establish efficient operational guidelines and governance frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
