&lt;p&gt;· Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

