&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Staff Backend Engineer, you will work on distributed systems and building next generation platform and products. You will help the team to bring industry best practices in software development and operations while improving their engineering skills to build pioneering e-commerce experience in new global markets. Working closely with a group of engineers in multiple geographic locations, you’ll solve challenge problems at scale with high reliability. Your efforts will directly have an impact on tens of millions of users every single day!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead architecture design for scalable, extensible, and reliable systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align technology roadmaps with leadership and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build productivity tools using Claude and Windsurf&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove technical blockers and simplify complex problems into actionable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write code when needed to guide teams and support high-priority initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify business and tech opportunities; evaluate and adopt new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, mentor, and grow top-tier engineering talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
