&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;nnual bonus is 0-20% of the base salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical/Dental/Vision/Life, AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/li&gt;
