&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an exceptionally pragmatic and results-driven Lead Data Analyst to be the strategic core of our Supply Chain team. Your mission is to solve our toughest demand forecasting and inventory challenges—from preventing stockouts to clearing excess goods. This is not a back-office reporting role. You will be a hands-on catalyst who can &quot;figure things out,&quot; develop clever solutions, and collaborate across the company to see your insights implemented in our production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideate&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Develop&amp;nbsp;Smart&amp;nbsp;Heuristics:&lt;/strong&gt;Proactively&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;weaknesses&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;develop&amp;nbsp;smart,&amp;nbsp;practical&amp;nbsp;logic from solving them.&amp;nbsp;Your&amp;nbsp;focus&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;driving demand forecast improvements,&amp;nbsp;Out-of-Stock&amp;nbsp;(OOS)&amp;nbsp;and excess inventory attribution&amp;nbsp;models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&amp;nbsp;Rapid&amp;nbsp;Proof-of-Concepts&amp;nbsp;(POCs):&lt;/strong&gt;Quickly&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;ideas&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;hands-on&amp;nbsp;POCs.&amp;nbsp;You&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;build&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;prototypes,&amp;nbsp;such&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;Root&amp;nbsp;Cause&amp;nbsp;Analysis&amp;nbsp;dashboard&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;automatically&amp;nbsp;attributes&amp;nbsp;OOS&amp;nbsp;events&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;causes&amp;nbsp;like&amp;nbsp;&#39;Under-forecasting&#39;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Analytics: &lt;/strong&gt;Participate&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;experimentation&amp;nbsp;design,&amp;nbsp;A/B&amp;nbsp;tests,&amp;nbsp;cohort&amp;nbsp;studies&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;measuring&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;effectiveness&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; prompt Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage Large Language Models (LLMs) and advanced prompt engineering to automate unstructured data, and accelerate internal analytical workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;Productionalization:&lt;/strong&gt;Partner&amp;nbsp;closely&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;Demand&amp;nbsp;Planning&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Engineering&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;get&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;validated&amp;nbsp;POCs&amp;nbsp;productionalized.&amp;nbsp;You&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;subjectmatter&amp;nbsp;expert&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;ensures&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;logic&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;accurately&amp;nbsp;integrated&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;core&amp;nbsp;inventory&amp;nbsp;planning&amp;nbsp;systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;GoTo&amp;nbsp;Expert:&lt;/strong&gt; Own&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;analytics&amp;nbsp;around&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain&amp;nbsp;KPIs,&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;demand forecast accuracy, Sell- through and forecast coverage.&amp;nbsp;You&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;not&amp;nbsp;just&amp;nbsp;report&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;these&amp;nbsp;numbers;&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;provide&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;&quot;why&quot;&amp;nbsp;behind&amp;nbsp;them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;Data&amp;nbsp;Translator:&lt;/strong&gt;Proactively&amp;nbsp;communicate&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;nontechnical&amp;nbsp;partners,&amp;nbsp;ensuring&amp;nbsp;stakeholders&amp;nbsp;understand&amp;nbsp;not&amp;nbsp;just&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;&#39;what&#39;&amp;nbsp;but&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;&#39;so&amp;nbsp;what&#39;&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;findings.&amp;nbsp;You&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;bridge&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;turns&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;analysis&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;clear&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;directives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
