&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Data Scientist at Coupang Ads, you will be responsible for :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product and Monetization strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: develop and test various auction and monetization models. Provide simulations of the possible impact of changes to be introduced on revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;: deliver a set of Key Performance Indicators, used for reporting on product adoption, usage, performance, and churn. Provide visibility into the effectiveness of the group’s monetization efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting&lt;/strong&gt;: design and maintain inventory and revenue forecasting models as a critical component of the revenue optimization process. Assist with analyzing sales patterns to identify trends and aid financial forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A/B Testing&lt;/strong&gt;: design, conduct, analyze and uncover insights from A/B tests to inform and prioritize product iterations. Do this with statistical rigor and perform cohort studies to answer “why?” on test result drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tell a Concise Story&lt;/strong&gt;: At completion of Tests, build timely, compelling, fact-based test recaps that strongly communicate the business ‘story’ behind the data and test outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
