&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills (Essential for seamless collaboration with global teams and multinational stakeholders).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in applied machine learning, with a proven track record of shipping and scaling production ML systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Agentic AI Systems: Hands-on experience designing and building multi-agent orchestration, planning, memory, and autonomous reasoning pipelines (e.g., ReAct, LangGraph).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Software Engineering Practices: Proficiency in Python combined with production-grade engineering disciplines (automated testing, rigorous code reviews, CI/CD, and scalable system design).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven Technical Leadership: Demonstrated ability to set technical directions, drive long-term roadmaps, mentor engineers, and establish alignment across cross-functional organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
