&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;exist&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;wow&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;customers.&amp;nbsp;We&amp;nbsp;know&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;doing&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;right&amp;nbsp;thing&amp;nbsp;when&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;hear&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;customers&amp;nbsp;say,&amp;nbsp;“How&amp;nbsp;did&amp;nbsp;I&amp;nbsp;ever&amp;nbsp;live&amp;nbsp;without&amp;nbsp;Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;Born&amp;nbsp;out&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;obsession&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;shopping,&amp;nbsp;eating,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;living&amp;nbsp;easier&amp;nbsp;than&amp;nbsp;ever,&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;collectively&amp;nbsp;disrupting&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;multi-billion-dollar&amp;nbsp;commerce&amp;nbsp;industry&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;ground&amp;nbsp;up.&amp;nbsp;We&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;American&amp;nbsp;technology&amp;nbsp;company&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;one&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;fastest-growing&amp;nbsp;retail&amp;nbsp;companies&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;has&amp;nbsp;established&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;unparalleled&amp;nbsp;reputation&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;being&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;leading&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;reliable&amp;nbsp;force&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;proud&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;best&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;both&amp;nbsp;worlds&amp;nbsp;—&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;startup&amp;nbsp;culture&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;resources&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;large&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;public&amp;nbsp;company.&amp;nbsp;This&amp;nbsp;fuels&amp;nbsp;us&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;continue&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;growth&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;launch&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;services&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;speed&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;been&amp;nbsp;since&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;inception.&amp;nbsp;We&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;all&amp;nbsp;entrepreneurial,&amp;nbsp;surrounded&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;opportunities&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;drive&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;initiatives&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;innovations.&amp;nbsp;At&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;core,&amp;nbsp;we&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;bold&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;ambitious&amp;nbsp;people&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;like&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;get&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;hands&amp;nbsp;dirty&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;hands-on&amp;nbsp;impact.&amp;nbsp;At&amp;nbsp;Coupang,&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;see&amp;nbsp;yourself,&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;colleagues,&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;team,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;company&amp;nbsp;grow&amp;nbsp;every&amp;nbsp;day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&amp;nbsp;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Coupang is seeking a highly technical and execution-focused Staff Technical Program Manager to lead Engineering Controls, Operational Governance, IT SOX Compliance, Security, Privacy and Technology Risk initiatives across Coupang&#39;s technology ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;This role sits at the intersection of software engineering, DevOps, cloud infrastructure, operational excellence, compliance, and AI-enabled governance. The primary focus is ownership of IT SOX Change Management controls and serving as a Second Line of Defense (2LOD) partner to engineering teams by independently assessing control effectiveness, monitoring software deployment activities, identifying compliance risks, and driving scalable engineering controls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;As Coupang continues to evolve its engineering platform, this role will help modernize compliance through automation, analytics, engineering telemetry, and AI-driven monitoring. The TPM will build a control environment that improves risk visibility, audit readiness, and operational excellence while minimizing compliance friction for engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Unlike traditional audit or compliance roles, this position requires deep expertise in modern software development, CI/CD, release management, cloud-native architectures, deployment automation, and engineering operations. The ideal candidate is a former Software Engineer, Platform Engineer, DevOps Engineer, or SRE who has transitioned into technical program leadership and can effectively partner with engineers, architects, security leaders, auditors, and executives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;You will work closely with Engineering, Platform, Security, Privacy, Finance, Internal Audit, and Governance teams to strengthen controls, automate compliance processes, improve reliability, and enable rapid software delivery without compromising risk objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Change Management Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Own the strategy, governance framework, and roadmap for IT SOX Change Management controls across Coupang&#39;s software development lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Evaluate release processes, CI/CD pipelines, and production deployments to ensure compliance requirements are consistently met.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Perform independent monitoring and oversight of deployment activities using engineering and compliance data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Identify compliance exceptions, unauthorized changes, control failures, and process gaps through continuous monitoring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Establish and improve controls related to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Code Reviews&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Release Approvals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Segregation of Duties (SoD)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Emergency Changes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Production Deployments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Change Monitoring and Reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Leverage AI, analytics, and deployment telemetry to identify elevated-risk changes, anomalous deployment patterns, and control exceptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Provide guidance to engineering teams and drive remediation of identified risks and control gaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Balance engineering velocity with effective risk management through automation and scalable controls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive CI/CD Governance &amp;amp; Engineering Controls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Partner with Platform Engineering teams to embed preventive and detective controls directly into software delivery workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Improve governance across CI/CD, release management, deployment authorization, and production change processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Define control observability frameworks that provide real-time visibility into software delivery controls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Partner with Platform and Data teams to develop automated monitoring capabilities that detect unauthorized changes, control bypasses, deployment anomalies, and emerging risks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Establish key control and risk indicators that proactively surface compliance concerns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Design monitoring and reporting solutions for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Release Compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Deployment Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Control Effectiveness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;SoD Violations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Emergency Changes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Change Failure Trends&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Develop metrics and dashboards that provide visibility into compliance, operational performance, and risk posture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Promote automation-first approaches to evidence generation, control testing, and compliance assurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security, Privacy &amp;amp; Technology Risk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Partner with Security, Privacy, and Risk organizations to align engineering controls with enterprise requirements and regulatory obligations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Support technology risk assessments, regulatory reviews, and remediation programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Drive consistent implementation of security, privacy, and risk controls across engineering organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Promote secure-by-design and privacy-by-design principles within software delivery processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Audit Readiness &amp;amp; Continuous Assurance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Own evidence collection processes supporting SOX audits and compliance reviews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Establish automated and repeatable evidence collection mechanisms that improve audit readiness and reduce manual effort.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Lead walkthroughs with Internal and External Audit teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary technical SME during audit engagements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Validate the completeness and accuracy of audit evidence and management responses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Establish continuous assurance capabilities through automated monitoring and risk-based assessments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Drive timely resolution of audit findings, control deficiencies, and remediation actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Information Systems, or a related technical field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in Software Engineering, Technical Program Management, Platform Engineering, DevOps, SRE, or related technical leadership roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience leading large-scale cross-functional technical programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Previous hands-on experience as a Software Engineer, Platform Engineer, Infrastructure Engineer, SRE, DevOps Engineer, or equivalent technical role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Experience operating in modern cloud-native software development environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Experience supporting SOX, ITGC, Change Management, Security, Privacy, or Technology Risk programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Experience partnering with engineering organizations responsible for enterprise-scale software delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Strong program management, stakeholder management, and executive communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in modern software engineering practices, including SDLC, CI/CD, release management, change management, and platform engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Strong experience with cloud-native architectures, Infrastructure as Code (IaC), site reliability engineering (SRE), and large-scale production operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with DevOps and deployment technologies such as GitHub Actions, Jenkins, ArgoCD, Spinnaker, Azure DevOps, Kubernetes, and Terraform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Proficiency in public cloud platforms, including AWS, Azure, or GCP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Experience leveraging data analytics, observability, and automation to improve engineering performance, operational excellence, and risk visibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to design and implement AI-enabled compliance solutions, including continuous control monitoring, automated evidence collection, and risk analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of SOX, ITGCs, change and access management controls, segregation of duties (SoD), and industry frameworks such as COBIT, COSO, NIST, and ISO 27001.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Professional certifications such as CISA, CISSP, CRISC, CIA, PMP, or cloud platform certifications are highly desirable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compensation reflects the cost of labor across several US geographic markets. At Coupang, your base pay is one part of your total compensation. The base pay for this position ranges from $155,000/year in our lowest geographic market to $267,000/year in our highest geographic market. Pay is based on several factors including market location and may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
